WEBVTT

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.142 line:80%
[♪ theme music playing]

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:35.002 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:00:38.088 --> 00:00:39.631 line:80%
CHARACTERS, EVENTS, ORGANIZATIONS,
AND PLACES IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

00:00:39.715 --> 00:00:41.008 line:80%
ALL CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
FILMED IN A SAFE ENVIRONMENT

00:00:41.592 --> 00:00:42.593 line:20%
Mr. Park.

00:00:42.676 --> 00:00:45.471 line:20%
Mr. Park, did you see…

00:00:47.973 --> 00:00:49.058 line:20%
[sighs]

00:00:51.602 --> 00:00:52.603 line:20%
[sighs]

00:00:53.979 --> 00:00:55.189 line:20%
I can't reach him.

00:00:55.272 --> 00:00:57.441 line:20%
He took his car and left

00:00:58.609 --> 00:01:00.069 line:20%
after 2:00 a.m. last night.

00:01:01.111 --> 00:01:02.446 line:20%
He has a bad fever.

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:04.573 line:20%
He's not in a state to drive right now.

00:01:04.657 --> 00:01:06.492 line:20%
Then I should call the police--

00:01:06.575 --> 00:01:07.576 line:20%
[Ben] Seonu Chan!

00:01:08.285 --> 00:01:09.286 line:20%
[Ben pants]

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:11.747 line:20%
-Ben.
-Is he here?

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:13.832 line:80%
I haven't been able to reach him.

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:16.335 line:80%
Why? Is something wrong?

00:01:16.418 --> 00:01:19.129 line:80%
He sent an email to the headquarters

00:01:19.755 --> 00:01:21.256 line:80%
saying he'll quit.

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:22.341 line:80%
What?

00:01:22.424 --> 00:01:23.759 line:80%
[Ben] I can't get in touch with him,

00:01:23.842 --> 00:01:26.595 line:80%
and they said he even deleted
his email account already.

00:01:27.846 --> 00:01:29.348 line:80%
He must have vanished on purpose.

00:01:29.932 --> 00:01:31.266 line:80%
[Manjae] Goodness.

00:01:32.935 --> 00:01:34.269 line:80%
[breathes deeply]

00:01:35.104 --> 00:01:37.106 line:80%
[♪ heartrending music playing]

00:01:39.733 --> 00:01:41.568 line:80%
[Manjae] He's been planning it
for a long time.

00:01:42.152 --> 00:01:44.947 line:80%
He said he wanted to be with you

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:46.740 line:80%
through spring, summer, fall, and winter.

00:01:47.199 --> 00:01:49.576 line:80%
He said he'd explain everything soon.

00:01:51.912 --> 00:01:54.623 line:80%
But it looks like
it's broken beyond repair.

00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:56.834 line:80%
He was hesitant

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:00.713 line:80%
because his memories weren't fully intact.

00:02:01.547 --> 00:02:03.757 line:80%
And he was worried that

00:02:03.841 --> 00:02:06.844 line:80%
acting rashly would only hurt you.

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:09.513 line:80%
He was going through a hard time too,

00:02:11.223 --> 00:02:14.143 line:80%
but his mind was only focused on you.

00:02:15.936 --> 00:02:19.273 line:80%
But it seems like
he missed several chances to tell you.

00:02:20.232 --> 00:02:22.318 line:80%
There was that issue
with your grandma too.

00:02:22.401 --> 00:02:23.569 line:80%
[sighs heavily]

00:02:24.361 --> 00:02:25.362 line:80%
I…

00:02:28.115 --> 00:02:29.700 line:80%
made him leave.

00:02:30.242 --> 00:02:32.161 line:80%
You don't have to look at me
or listen to me.

00:02:32.244 --> 00:02:33.454 line:80%
Please, just look at this.

00:02:34.705 --> 00:02:35.789 line:80%
<i>So please…</i>

00:02:35.873 --> 00:02:38.167 line:80%
No exceptions.
Don't let anyone in my office.

00:02:39.752 --> 00:02:41.837 line:80%
<i>Don't ever show up in front of me again.</i>

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:44.423 line:80%
You just pushed me back into winter again.

00:02:44.506 --> 00:02:46.884 line:80%
<i>I should have listened to him at least.</i>

00:02:47.676 --> 00:02:48.969 line:80%
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:02:50.429 --> 00:02:53.057 line:80%
Regardless of whose roommate
he was seven years ago,

00:02:55.017 --> 00:02:56.977 line:80%
what secrets he hid…

00:03:00.022 --> 00:03:02.399 line:80%
[sighs] or what he did wrong,

00:03:04.485 --> 00:03:06.320 line:80%
I really can't hate him.

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:08.238 line:80%
[♪ music swells]

00:03:08.322 --> 00:03:09.323 line:80%
[sighs]

00:03:38.227 --> 00:03:39.853 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:03:39.937 --> 00:03:42.189 line:80%
[Sujin] <i>I'm only visiting.</i>
<i>I came from Boston.</i>

00:03:46.485 --> 00:03:47.486 line:80%
[♪ music ends]

00:03:55.035 --> 00:03:56.620 line:80%
END OF TRIAL

00:03:56.704 --> 00:03:58.330 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:03:58.414 --> 00:03:59.665 line:80%
[breathes deeply]

00:03:59.748 --> 00:04:00.916 line:80%
[Chan] <i>A three-month trial!</i>

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:04.211 line:80%
As soon as the three months is over,
I'll disappear without a trace.

00:04:04.294 --> 00:04:06.422 line:80%
I'm not someone who will leave
in three months,

00:04:07.548 --> 00:04:09.591 line:80%
nor someone who might never come back.

00:04:09.675 --> 00:04:10.968 line:80%
Ms. Song.

00:04:11.552 --> 00:04:14.221 line:80%
No, Haran. I want to stay with you.

00:04:14.304 --> 00:04:17.975 line:80%
I'm going to use that trial
for the rest of my life.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:21.687 line:80%
[breathing heavily] When did he come here?

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:26.442 line:80%
[breathing heavily]

00:04:27.443 --> 00:04:28.944 line:80%
Where did you go, Seonu Chan?

00:04:30.904 --> 00:04:32.448 line:80%
-[shudders]
-[♪ music fades]

00:04:34.992 --> 00:04:37.077 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Then that accident…</i>

00:04:37.161 --> 00:04:39.580 line:80%
[Sujin] Yes. It was all because of you.

00:04:39.663 --> 00:04:42.541 line:80%
You caused the accident,
and it killed Hyeokchan.

00:04:47.171 --> 00:04:49.590 line:80%
[panting]

00:04:50.758 --> 00:04:52.384 line:80%
[breathes deeply]

00:04:53.927 --> 00:04:54.928 line:80%
[Haran] <i>He…</i>

00:04:55.804 --> 00:04:56.847 line:80%
disappeared.

00:04:58.682 --> 00:05:02.478 line:80%
The Seonu Chan I know
would never just leave like that.

00:05:03.771 --> 00:05:05.939 line:80%
I'm sure there must be a reason.

00:05:07.399 --> 00:05:09.360 line:80%
But I didn't even give him
a chance to talk.

00:05:10.361 --> 00:05:11.570 line:80%
So I'm regretting it.

00:05:15.157 --> 00:05:17.785 line:80%
You, he, and Hyeokchan knew each other

00:05:18.494 --> 00:05:19.578 line:80%
in Boston, right?

00:05:22.247 --> 00:05:23.374 line:80%
Yes.

00:05:25.167 --> 00:05:26.585 line:80%
His disappearance

00:05:26.669 --> 00:05:29.129 line:80%
seems to be connected
to what happened seven years ago.

00:05:30.297 --> 00:05:32.091 line:80%
What happened back then?

00:05:33.133 --> 00:05:34.134 line:80%
Please tell me.

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:36.053 line:80%
I have to know.

00:05:39.014 --> 00:05:40.099 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:05:41.642 --> 00:05:42.851 line:80%
Seven years ago,

00:05:43.936 --> 00:05:45.854 line:80%
I did something bad to you.

00:05:46.772 --> 00:05:48.107 line:80%
[♪ somber music playing]

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:50.818 line:80%
I met Hyeokchan for the first time
at a hospital.

00:05:52.194 --> 00:05:55.906 line:80%
He and I were both waiting for a surgery.

00:05:55.990 --> 00:05:57.950 line:80%
He was pretty stressed back then

00:05:58.701 --> 00:06:00.995 line:80%
because he couldn't reach you often.

00:06:02.997 --> 00:06:03.998 line:80%
What time is it?

00:06:04.707 --> 00:06:08.085 line:80%
[exclaims, groans]
I missed his calls again.

00:06:08.168 --> 00:06:09.420 line:80%
[laptop pings]

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:12.381 line:80%
[Hyeokchan] <i>Did you download it?</i>
<i>Can you see my message?</i>

00:06:12.464 --> 00:06:13.841 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Yes, I can see it!</i>

00:06:14.591 --> 00:06:15.884 line:80%
[Hyeokchan] <i>You kept missing my calls,</i>

00:06:15.968 --> 00:06:19.722 line:80%
<i>so I thought we could at least</i>
<i>send each other messages on our laptops.</i>

00:06:22.725 --> 00:06:25.060 line:80%
<i>-I'm going to bed now. Love you.</i>
-[groans]

00:06:25.144 --> 00:06:26.979 line:80%
Oh, no…

00:06:27.062 --> 00:06:29.106 line:80%
The silk georgette…

00:06:29.189 --> 00:06:31.692 line:80%
-Haran, the draping fabric.
-[Haran] Coming.

00:06:31.775 --> 00:06:33.152 line:80%
<i>Sorry, I'm in a bit of a hurry.</i>

00:06:33.235 --> 00:06:34.903 line:80%
<i>I'll call you back later. Sorry.</i>

00:06:39.325 --> 00:06:40.951 line:80%
[in English] You shouldn't be smoking.

00:06:42.619 --> 00:06:43.620 line:80%
[in Korean] None of your business.

00:06:44.538 --> 00:06:45.539 line:80%
Are you Korean?

00:06:48.584 --> 00:06:50.753 line:80%
[both sigh heavily]

00:06:50.836 --> 00:06:52.963 line:80%
Let's meet up and chat from time to time.

00:06:53.047 --> 00:06:54.631 line:80%
We're both lonely students here.

00:06:55.382 --> 00:06:56.717 line:80%
[scoffs]

00:06:57.718 --> 00:06:59.094 line:80%
[Sujin] <i>We were the same age,</i>

00:06:59.178 --> 00:07:01.639 line:80%
<i>and we were both lonely students</i>
<i>studying abroad.</i>

00:07:01.722 --> 00:07:03.599 line:80%
<i>So we grew close quickly.</i>

00:07:03.682 --> 00:07:04.808 line:80%
[♪ music swells]

00:07:07.144 --> 00:07:09.104 line:80%
You were the only one
who could bring this.

00:07:09.188 --> 00:07:11.982 line:80%
But I didn't have your number,
so I asked the T.A.

00:07:12.066 --> 00:07:13.859 line:80%
Sorry for the hassle.

00:07:16.445 --> 00:07:17.655 line:80%
[sighs]

00:07:19.323 --> 00:07:20.324 line:80%
My number.

00:07:20.407 --> 00:07:22.660 line:80%
Call me if you need anything.
Not too often, though.

00:07:27.247 --> 00:07:29.208 line:80%
[exclaims, in English] Sorry.

00:07:29.291 --> 00:07:31.335 line:80%
[in Korean] <i>I heard</i>
<i>he wasn't close with his roommate,</i>

00:07:31.418 --> 00:07:33.587 line:80%
<i>but he asked Seonu Chan for a favor,</i>

00:07:33.671 --> 00:07:35.255 line:80%
<i>and that's when I first met him.</i>

00:07:35.339 --> 00:07:38.217 line:80%
-Who's that? Your friend?
-No, just my roommate.

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:41.387 line:80%
[cell phone vibrating]

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:45.140 line:80%
[Sujin] <i>We developed feelings</i>
<i>for each other as we grew close.</i>

00:07:45.224 --> 00:07:46.308 line:80%
[sighs]

00:07:46.392 --> 00:07:47.393 line:80%
[laptop pings]

00:07:47.476 --> 00:07:49.728 line:80%
<i>We kept seeing each other</i>
<i>after we were discharged.</i>

00:07:49.812 --> 00:07:52.189 line:80%
<i>That's when Hyeokchan</i>
<i>started making excuses</i>

00:07:52.272 --> 00:07:54.400 line:80%
<i>and asking his roommate for favors.</i>

00:07:55.109 --> 00:07:57.069 line:80%
<i>He canceled his plans to go to Korea</i>

00:07:57.152 --> 00:07:59.113 line:80%
<i>and went traveling with me</i>
<i>during vacation,</i>

00:07:59.196 --> 00:08:01.949 line:80%
<i>but he accidentally took</i>
<i>his roommate's laptop instead.</i>

00:08:02.032 --> 00:08:03.617 line:80%
And during that one month,

00:08:05.369 --> 00:08:07.997 line:80%
I think Seonu Chan was chatting

00:08:09.331 --> 00:08:10.582 line:80%
with you

00:08:11.208 --> 00:08:12.334 line:80%
on Hyeokchan's laptop.

00:08:13.252 --> 00:08:17.297 line:80%
Hyeokchan had already made up his mind
to break up with you.

00:08:17.381 --> 00:08:19.174 line:80%
I'm sorry, but the reason was me.

00:08:21.385 --> 00:08:23.971 line:80%
Seonu Chan didn't start it intentionally.

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:28.267 line:80%
It was Hyeokchan's mistake,
and he asked him to message you.

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:29.351 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:08:29.435 --> 00:08:31.687 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Did you have fun</i>
<i>chatting with me like that?</i>

00:08:32.563 --> 00:08:35.274 line:80%
Did you build some kind of fantasy
and start liking me?

00:08:36.817 --> 00:08:38.402 line:80%
Even though I knew about you,

00:08:40.279 --> 00:08:41.655 line:80%
I wanted Hyeokchan.

00:08:43.073 --> 00:08:44.074 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:08:45.951 --> 00:08:47.453 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:08:49.288 --> 00:08:50.789 line:80%
All right.

00:08:54.543 --> 00:08:55.544 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:08:55.627 --> 00:08:57.004 line:80%
[gasps] Seonu Chan…

00:08:58.339 --> 00:08:59.798 line:80%
disappeared because of me.

00:09:04.928 --> 00:09:07.264 line:80%
[presenter] If his bleeding
was caused by the shrapnel,

00:09:07.348 --> 00:09:08.891 line:80%
it may be accompanied

00:09:08.974 --> 00:09:11.393 line:80%
by neurological symptoms
such as auditory or visual hallucinations.

00:09:11.477 --> 00:09:14.104 line:80%
There have even been reports
of memory distortion

00:09:14.188 --> 00:09:15.981 line:80%
in severe cases like this.

00:09:16.065 --> 00:09:17.941 line:80%
Memory distortion?

00:09:18.651 --> 00:09:20.736 line:80%
His memories are distorted?

00:09:20.819 --> 00:09:22.029 line:80%
[Sujin] I had no idea

00:09:22.112 --> 00:09:25.366 line:80%
he'd been suffering so much
from the explosion back then.

00:09:25.449 --> 00:09:30.204 line:80%
He told me never to tell you
about Hyeokchan and me,

00:09:30.746 --> 00:09:32.498 line:80%
but I thought I should tell you.

00:09:32.581 --> 00:09:34.166 line:80%
I get that about Hyeokchan,

00:09:34.792 --> 00:09:35.959 line:80%
but what do you mean?

00:09:36.627 --> 00:09:37.628 line:80%
Why did he disappear--

00:09:37.711 --> 00:09:39.588 line:80%
I did something…

00:09:40.798 --> 00:09:43.509 line:80%
I shouldn't have done,
as a person and as a doctor.

00:09:44.134 --> 00:09:46.136 line:80%
[♪ sentimental music playing]

00:09:48.639 --> 00:09:50.182 line:80%
[sighs]

00:09:56.438 --> 00:09:57.606 line:80%
[Hayeong] <i>Your passport? Why?</i>

00:09:57.690 --> 00:09:59.358 line:80%
I'm going to Boston to meet Chan,

00:09:59.441 --> 00:10:00.901 line:80%
since we have four days off.

00:10:00.985 --> 00:10:02.611 line:80%
What? Really?

00:10:03.445 --> 00:10:05.280 line:80%
You seem different these days.

00:10:05.364 --> 00:10:06.615 line:80%
What? Why?

00:10:06.699 --> 00:10:10.452 line:80%
Just a while back,
you didn't seem that into him.

00:10:10.536 --> 00:10:11.912 line:80%
Was that a month ago?

00:10:11.996 --> 00:10:14.206 line:80%
What's this sudden burst of affection?

00:10:15.082 --> 00:10:16.166 line:80%
[Haran] <i>I don't know, either.</i>

00:10:16.625 --> 00:10:19.586 line:80%
<i>When we were together,</i>
<i>I didn't notice him much,</i>

00:10:19.670 --> 00:10:22.548 line:80%
<i>but I feel like I can see him clearer</i>
<i>when I'm chatting with him</i>

00:10:22.631 --> 00:10:24.008 line:80%
<i>without seeing or hearing him.</i>

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:28.345 line:80%
<i>I can tell how much he understands me</i>
<i>and how well we click.</i>

00:10:29.179 --> 00:10:32.391 line:80%
<i>Maybe it's because of this pen.</i>
[chuckles softly]

00:10:32.474 --> 00:10:34.101 line:80%
[sobbing]

00:10:35.602 --> 00:10:36.729 line:80%
[whimpers] What do I do?

00:10:41.025 --> 00:10:42.067 line:80%
What do I do?

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:47.448 line:80%
What do I do?

00:10:53.245 --> 00:10:55.122 line:80%
[wind whooshes]

00:10:55.205 --> 00:10:58.167 line:80%
-[leaves rustling]
-[birds chirping]

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.169 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:11:00.252 --> 00:11:01.253 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:11:02.171 --> 00:11:03.505 line:80%
Mr. Yeon.

00:11:04.757 --> 00:11:06.133 line:80%
I'm going to the factory.

00:11:06.216 --> 00:11:10.095 line:80%
I'm meeting Mr. Chae
in front of the factory at 4:00 p.m.

00:11:10.179 --> 00:11:13.849 line:80%
I heard it's in Gangwon-do Province.
It's pretty far, so drive safely.

00:11:15.893 --> 00:11:18.854 line:80%
But what happened to your keychain?

00:11:18.937 --> 00:11:21.148 line:80%
Oh, I'm taking the company car
since it's far away.

00:11:21.231 --> 00:11:24.109 line:80%
Ah. Sorry, I can't come with you.

00:11:24.193 --> 00:11:26.487 line:80%
[exclaims teasingly]
No need to apologize for that.

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:29.448 line:80%
I know you're insanely busy
with Ms. Kim absent.

00:11:29.531 --> 00:11:31.700 line:80%
I'll see you later, then.

00:11:36.288 --> 00:11:37.998 line:80%
It's going to take so long.

00:11:40.876 --> 00:11:42.753 line:80%
I have to cheer him up.

00:11:42.836 --> 00:11:44.546 line:80%
[breathes deeply]

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:45.631 line:80%
Smile.

00:11:50.511 --> 00:11:51.512 line:80%
Huh?

00:11:55.015 --> 00:11:56.016 line:80%
"Kim."

00:12:00.312 --> 00:12:01.480 line:80%
YOUGYUM

00:12:02.356 --> 00:12:04.733 line:80%
-[breathing heavily]
-[line ringing]

00:12:06.443 --> 00:12:08.487 line:80%
-[sighs] Why isn't he picking up?
-[line disconnects]

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:12.908 line:80%
[line connects, ringing]

00:12:15.202 --> 00:12:17.663 line:80%
Yang Changmo.
Do you know where Yougyum is?

00:12:17.746 --> 00:12:19.748 line:80%
[Changmo] <i>He's taking his stuff</i>
<i>out of his locker.</i>

00:12:19.832 --> 00:12:21.250 line:80%
<i>He says he's quitting baseball.</i>

00:12:22.042 --> 00:12:23.460 line:80%
-What?
<i>-He said</i>

00:12:23.544 --> 00:12:25.921 line:80%
<i>he won't be able to become</i>
<i>a pro athlete anyway.</i>

00:12:27.881 --> 00:12:28.882 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:12:34.888 --> 00:12:35.931 line:80%
CHA YOUGYUM

00:12:37.474 --> 00:12:38.726 line:80%
[breathing shakily]

00:12:50.404 --> 00:12:51.905 line:80%
[Hadam] In 2007,

00:12:51.989 --> 00:12:54.241 line:80%
Park Jisung got knee surgery

00:12:54.325 --> 00:12:56.910 line:80%
and returned to Manchester United
after nine months.

00:12:56.994 --> 00:12:59.079 line:80%
He made it
to the Champions League semifinals.

00:13:04.043 --> 00:13:05.753 line:80%
In 2025,

00:13:05.836 --> 00:13:09.340 line:80%
Shohei Ohtani returned
from two elbow surgeries

00:13:09.423 --> 00:13:11.008 line:80%
and threw even faster than before,

00:13:11.091 --> 00:13:13.761 line:80%
rewriting his Major League career records.

00:13:13.844 --> 00:13:15.387 line:80%
[voice breaking] And in 2015,

00:13:15.971 --> 00:13:17.389 line:80%
Ryu Hyunjin…

00:13:19.266 --> 00:13:20.601 line:80%
[stutters] had a shoulder tear…

00:13:21.352 --> 00:13:22.353 line:80%
Shoulder tear…

00:13:23.187 --> 00:13:24.897 line:80%
[♪ heartwarming music playing]

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:25.981 line:80%
Hadam, stop.

00:13:27.358 --> 00:13:28.359 line:80%
That's enough.

00:13:29.526 --> 00:13:30.527 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:13:32.279 --> 00:13:33.614 line:80%
I'm really sorry,

00:13:34.531 --> 00:13:35.616 line:80%
but I can't make it.

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:38.202 line:80%
Those athletes

00:13:39.078 --> 00:13:41.497 line:80%
took much longer to recover than expected.

00:13:42.623 --> 00:13:43.999 line:80%
But they returned stronger.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:47.211 line:80%
You don't have to play baseball.

00:13:47.294 --> 00:13:49.672 line:80%
And you don't have to join
the Major League.

00:13:49.755 --> 00:13:50.839 line:80%
But…

00:13:51.548 --> 00:13:53.801 line:80%
if you give up now
without trying until the end,

00:13:53.884 --> 00:13:55.260 line:80%
all you can do later…

00:13:57.096 --> 00:13:58.180 line:80%
is regret it.

00:13:59.890 --> 00:14:01.809 line:80%
Let's try everything we can until the end.

00:14:02.309 --> 00:14:03.769 line:80%
You can give up then.

00:14:04.728 --> 00:14:06.730 line:80%
Until you find something else
you want to do,

00:14:07.898 --> 00:14:09.441 line:80%
I'll take care of you, so--

00:14:09.525 --> 00:14:10.526 line:80%
I'm scared.

00:14:13.529 --> 00:14:16.699 line:80%
I'm scared I'll turn out to be nothing
even after I try.

00:14:20.786 --> 00:14:21.787 line:80%
Then,

00:14:22.621 --> 00:14:24.665 line:80%
you can be the Cha Yougyum

00:14:25.708 --> 00:14:27.835 line:80%
who at least tried his best until the end.

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:29.461 line:80%
You can be that.

00:14:30.254 --> 00:14:32.673 line:80%
Then you won't turn out to be nothing.

00:14:32.756 --> 00:14:34.299 line:80%
You helped me stay strong

00:14:35.426 --> 00:14:37.011 line:80%
when I was having a rough time.

00:14:38.512 --> 00:14:40.514 line:80%
So it's my turn to help you stand back up.

00:14:40.973 --> 00:14:44.018 line:80%
Even if you give up baseball,
I won't let go of your hand.

00:14:44.101 --> 00:14:45.769 line:80%
I'll stay with you until the end.

00:14:46.228 --> 00:14:47.229 line:80%
[breathes shakily]

00:14:48.981 --> 00:14:50.107 line:80%
So let's not…

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:52.776 line:80%
run away from this.

00:14:58.073 --> 00:14:59.074 line:80%
[sniffles]

00:15:00.034 --> 00:15:01.035 line:80%
I'll give it a try.

00:15:02.453 --> 00:15:05.289 line:80%
We can cry later if I still can't do it.

00:15:05.748 --> 00:15:07.082 line:80%
But right now,

00:15:08.917 --> 00:15:09.918 line:80%
let's try this.

00:15:16.633 --> 00:15:18.510 line:80%
[cell phone ringing]

00:15:18.594 --> 00:15:19.595 line:80%
REPORTER CHAE HYUNWOO

00:15:20.137 --> 00:15:21.680 line:80%
-Yes, Mr. Chae.
-[Hyunwoo] <i>Hey.</i>

00:15:21.764 --> 00:15:24.266 line:80%
<i>We rescheduled the factory visit</i>
<i>to next Wednesday.</i>

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:25.392 line:80%
<i>Can you join us then?</i>

00:15:25.476 --> 00:15:26.727 line:80%
What are you talking about?

00:15:27.353 --> 00:15:29.480 line:80%
Ms. Song just left for Yeongwol.

00:15:29.563 --> 00:15:32.566 line:80%
<i>Huh? I left her a message</i>
<i>saying it got canceled.</i>

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:35.319 line:80%
<i>We can't enter</i>
<i>because of a blizzard warning.</i>

00:15:36.111 --> 00:15:37.196 line:80%
[sighs]

00:15:37.279 --> 00:15:39.114 line:80%
MR. YEON

00:15:41.992 --> 00:15:46.705 line:80%
Hello, this is Song Hayeong's phone
that she leaves lying around every day.

00:15:46.789 --> 00:15:47.790 line:80%
[line disconnects]

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:51.335 line:80%
[Taeseok sighs worriedly]

00:15:53.295 --> 00:15:54.546 line:80%
Chae Hyunwoo.

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:57.508 line:80%
You should've checked
to see if she got the message.

00:15:57.591 --> 00:15:59.593 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

00:16:00.552 --> 00:16:01.845 line:80%
Send me the address.

00:16:01.929 --> 00:16:03.639 line:80%
-[breath trembling]
-[line disconnects]

00:16:03.722 --> 00:16:06.225 line:80%
[line connects, rings]

00:16:06.308 --> 00:16:07.309 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:16:07.393 --> 00:16:10.479 line:80%
Something urgent came up,
so I have to postpone the meeting.

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:13.232 line:80%
[sighs] I'm really sorry.

00:16:18.612 --> 00:16:20.531 line:80%
-[engine revving]
-[♪ music continues]

00:16:22.116 --> 00:16:25.160 line:80%
[Hayeong groans] I can't believe this.

00:16:25.703 --> 00:16:26.704 line:80%
What is this?

00:16:27.871 --> 00:16:28.872 line:80%
Huh?

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:33.585 line:80%
This is driving me crazy.

00:16:38.007 --> 00:16:40.718 line:80%
[officer] You can't enter
because of the heavy snow.

00:16:40.801 --> 00:16:43.345 line:80%
-You have to head back, all right?
-[tire screeches]

00:16:46.724 --> 00:16:48.100 line:80%
Hang on.

00:16:48.183 --> 00:16:49.310 line:80%
Excuse me.

00:16:49.393 --> 00:16:50.936 line:80%
You can't enter. Excuse me!

00:16:51.729 --> 00:16:53.981 line:80%
Sir! Wait!

00:16:54.064 --> 00:16:55.065 line:80%
[moans]

00:16:56.233 --> 00:16:59.945 line:80%
My car won't start,
and I don't even have my phone.

00:17:01.322 --> 00:17:03.657 line:80%
[yawns] It's so cold.

00:17:04.742 --> 00:17:05.743 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:17:05.826 --> 00:17:09.455 line:80%
[gasps loudly] You can't fall asleep,
Song Hayeong.

00:17:09.955 --> 00:17:11.874 line:80%
Am I going to die here?

00:17:13.542 --> 00:17:14.585 line:80%
Well…

00:17:15.336 --> 00:17:17.838 line:80%
I've lived a happy life.

00:17:18.464 --> 00:17:21.175 line:80%
[groans] I was so stupid.

00:17:22.259 --> 00:17:23.677 line:80%
-[sighs]
-[Taeseok] Ms. Song Hayeong.

00:17:24.678 --> 00:17:25.888 line:80%
-[moans]
-[Taeseok] Ms. Song!

00:17:25.971 --> 00:17:29.016 line:80%
Why am I hallucinating Mr. Yeon's voice
in a moment like this?

00:17:29.099 --> 00:17:31.101 line:80%
[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:17:33.729 --> 00:17:34.730 line:80%
Huh?

00:17:36.857 --> 00:17:38.776 line:80%
[stutters] Mr. Yeon?

00:17:41.779 --> 00:17:42.780 line:80%
Ms. Song.

00:17:44.531 --> 00:17:45.908 line:80%
Are you all right?

00:17:46.367 --> 00:17:48.535 line:80%
Is that really you, Mr. Yeon?

00:17:49.536 --> 00:17:50.579 line:80%
Yes, it's me.

00:17:51.789 --> 00:17:53.582 line:80%
[panting]

00:17:53.666 --> 00:17:54.792 line:80%
Everything's okay now.

00:17:57.878 --> 00:18:00.798 line:80%
I'll call a car service right away.
Just a moment.

00:18:04.259 --> 00:18:05.260 line:80%
Wow.

00:18:10.307 --> 00:18:11.725 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:18:16.563 --> 00:18:18.732 line:80%
I'm fine, so take this…

00:18:18.816 --> 00:18:19.858 line:80%
No.

00:18:20.526 --> 00:18:22.861 line:80%
-Keep it on.
-[scoffs]

00:18:22.945 --> 00:18:25.864 line:80%
Don't make me get the wrong idea again.

00:18:26.323 --> 00:18:30.285 line:80%
You would've rushed over
even if it were Haran or Hadam, right?

00:18:30.369 --> 00:18:32.287 line:80%
[♪ heartwarming music playing]

00:18:32.371 --> 00:18:33.372 line:80%
[Hayeong clears throat]

00:18:35.958 --> 00:18:37.334 line:80%
I'm not sure.

00:18:38.711 --> 00:18:39.712 line:80%
What?

00:18:41.964 --> 00:18:43.424 line:80%
I think I was wrong.

00:18:44.216 --> 00:18:45.259 line:80%
What…

00:18:45.342 --> 00:18:46.510 line:80%
I think I do see you…

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:49.930 line:80%
as more than a colleague.

00:18:59.732 --> 00:19:02.067 line:80%
I told myself I couldn't dare to,

00:19:03.402 --> 00:19:04.987 line:80%
since you're Ms. Kim's granddaughter.

00:19:07.197 --> 00:19:10.951 line:80%
So I guess I turned away from my feelings.

00:19:15.664 --> 00:19:17.666 line:80%
How could I not be attracted

00:19:19.335 --> 00:19:22.629 line:80%
to someone like you?

00:19:26.175 --> 00:19:27.593 line:80%
I know it's pretty late,

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:32.014 line:80%
but if you're really okay
with someone like me…

00:19:37.144 --> 00:19:38.562 line:80%
would it be all right

00:19:40.022 --> 00:19:41.231 line:80%
for me to like you?

00:19:55.079 --> 00:19:56.497 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:19:58.832 --> 00:19:59.875 line:80%
Gosh…

00:20:00.417 --> 00:20:02.503 line:80%
Let's clean up this place

00:20:03.545 --> 00:20:05.798 line:80%
so Chan can return anytime.

00:20:06.674 --> 00:20:08.676 line:80%
[♪ uplifting song playing]

00:20:15.599 --> 00:20:17.101 line:80%
[birds chirping]

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:32.741 line:80%
[knock on door]

00:20:34.284 --> 00:20:35.369 line:80%
Yes?

00:20:36.912 --> 00:20:38.872 line:80%
Ms. Song, there's a delivery for you.

00:20:50.676 --> 00:20:51.760 line:80%
[exclaims softly]

00:20:51.844 --> 00:20:53.137 line:80%
[Chan's grandma] <i>Have you been well?</i>

00:20:53.721 --> 00:20:55.264 line:80%
<i>It took a while,</i>

00:20:55.889 --> 00:20:57.766 line:80%
<i>but I put it together.</i>

00:20:59.435 --> 00:21:01.937 line:80%
[knife scraping]

00:21:02.646 --> 00:21:07.735 line:80%
<i>Restoration begins the moment</i>
<i>you decide to put it back together.</i>

00:21:08.235 --> 00:21:09.445 line:80%
<i>It may take a while,</i>

00:21:09.528 --> 00:21:13.699 line:80%
<i>but as long as you don't give up,</i>
<i>the pieces will come together in the end,</i>

00:21:14.199 --> 00:21:15.743 line:80%
<i>and those pieces</i>

00:21:16.327 --> 00:21:18.829 line:80%
<i>will contain a deeper story</i>
<i>compared to before.</i>

00:21:19.371 --> 00:21:21.290 line:80%
<i>I learned through this job</i>

00:21:22.333 --> 00:21:26.253 line:80%
<i>that miracles begin by not giving up.</i>

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:29.590 line:80%
<i>If there is anything you wish to fix,</i>

00:21:30.299 --> 00:21:34.970 line:80%
<i>I hope a miracle occurs for you as well.</i>

00:21:36.347 --> 00:21:38.307 line:80%
Not giving up…

00:21:54.490 --> 00:21:55.991 line:80%
[Haran panting]

00:22:00.746 --> 00:22:03.415 line:80%
The service center refused
since the model is discontinued.

00:22:03.499 --> 00:22:04.958 line:80%
Will you be able to fix it?

00:22:05.042 --> 00:22:07.878 line:80%
I could try if I had new parts for this,

00:22:07.961 --> 00:22:12.174 line:80%
but it'll be hard since this model
was sold briefly over 10 years ago.

00:22:12.675 --> 00:22:13.676 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:22:16.178 --> 00:22:19.056 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Would anyone</i>
<i>be able to fix this drawing pad?</i>

00:22:19.139 --> 00:22:21.642 line:80%
<i>I'll repay anyone</i>
<i>who can at least recover the data.</i>

00:22:24.853 --> 00:22:26.897 line:20%
-[cell phone pings]
-[commenter 1] <i>What's this? An old tablet?</i>

00:22:26.981 --> 00:22:28.607 line:20%
[commenter 2]
<i>A drawing pad like this exists?</i>

00:22:30.651 --> 00:22:31.860 line:80%
[cell phone vibrates]

00:22:35.531 --> 00:22:37.741 line:80%
[commenter 3] <i>Wow,</i>
<i>I used this in middle school.</i>

00:22:37.825 --> 00:22:39.618 line:80%
<i>It's probably stashed somewhere.</i>

00:22:41.453 --> 00:22:43.372 line:80%
[repairman] <i>I could try</i>
<i>if I had new parts for this.</i>

00:22:43.455 --> 00:22:44.456 line:80%
[cell phone pings]

00:22:46.208 --> 00:22:49.336 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Are you willing</i>
<i>to sell it to me if you find it?</i>

00:22:49.420 --> 00:22:51.839 line:80%
<i>If you are, please message me.</i>

00:22:56.427 --> 00:22:58.846 line:80%
ARE YOU WILLING
TO SELL IT TO ME IF YOU FIND IT?

00:23:01.307 --> 00:23:03.434 line:80%
[cell phone vibrating]

00:23:07.146 --> 00:23:08.147 line:80%
Hello?

00:23:08.230 --> 00:23:10.649 line:80%
[woman] <i>Are you the one</i>
<i>who left a message saying</i>

00:23:10.733 --> 00:23:13.152 line:80%
<i>-you wanted to buy my drawing pad?</i>
-Yes, I am.

00:23:14.695 --> 00:23:16.864 line:80%
I found a working drawing pad.

00:23:16.947 --> 00:23:19.158 line:80%
The parts are in there,
so you can fix it, right?

00:23:19.867 --> 00:23:22.661 line:80%
I can't guarantee that,
but you can leave it with me.

00:23:23.329 --> 00:23:24.330 line:80%
[sighs hopefully]

00:23:28.292 --> 00:23:29.710 line:80%
[repairman] <i>Thanks to the new parts,</i>

00:23:29.793 --> 00:23:33.380 line:80%
<i>I managed to restore the data</i>
<i>and move it to another device.</i>

00:23:33.922 --> 00:23:35.507 line:80%
to HARAN

00:23:37.885 --> 00:23:38.886 line:80%
[♪ music ends]

00:23:47.728 --> 00:23:52.232 line:80%
1. SUMMER, SEVEN YEARS AGO
IT STARTED WITH WALLS

00:23:52.316 --> 00:23:54.318 line:80%
[♪ emotional music playing]

00:23:58.405 --> 00:23:59.740 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Hyeokchan and I</i>

00:23:59.823 --> 00:24:02.117 line:80%
<i>were roommates</i>
<i>at the Boston Institute of Technology.</i>

00:24:02.618 --> 00:24:05.204 line:80%
Can you message her back
and say I have to go to the lab?

00:24:05.287 --> 00:24:06.830 line:80%
Do me a solid.

00:24:08.874 --> 00:24:10.459 line:80%
[laptop pinging]

00:24:10.542 --> 00:24:13.796 line:80%
[Chan] <i>One day, I was about to turn off</i>
<i>Hyeokchan's messenger alarm,</i>

00:24:14.505 --> 00:24:16.382 line:80%
<i>but your words caught my eye.</i>

00:24:17.257 --> 00:24:18.592 line:80%
<i>"Surrounded by walls."</i>

00:24:19.259 --> 00:24:21.303 line:80%
<i>Perhaps because I'd been feeling that way,</i>

00:24:22.554 --> 00:24:24.723 line:80%
<i>I wanted to be someone you could talk to.</i>

00:24:25.641 --> 00:24:27.810 line:80%
<i>I could guess</i>
<i>how lost you would be feeling.</i>

00:24:27.893 --> 00:24:29.395 line:80%
IF IT'S OKAY WITH YOU, YOU CAN TALK TO ME

00:24:29.478 --> 00:24:31.522 line:80%
[keyboard clacking]

00:24:36.860 --> 00:24:37.945 line:80%
[sighs heavily]

00:24:38.779 --> 00:24:40.781 line:80%
[Chan] <i>All I did was listen to you,</i>

00:24:41.657 --> 00:24:44.076 line:80%
<i>but strangely, it comforted me too.</i>

00:24:47.579 --> 00:24:50.165 line:20%
THANKS FOR LISTENING TO ME COMPLAIN!

00:24:50.833 --> 00:24:52.126 line:80%
<i>I thought</i>

00:24:52.793 --> 00:24:55.337 line:80%
<i>that would be</i>
<i>our first and last conversation.</i>

00:24:55.421 --> 00:24:56.714 line:80%
<i>But…</i>

00:24:58.882 --> 00:25:00.426 line:80%
2. FOUNTAIN PEN, AND ENGRAVING

00:25:00.509 --> 00:25:02.678 line:80%
<i>Around that time,</i>
<i>Hyeokchan hurt his hand badly,</i>

00:25:03.554 --> 00:25:05.264 line:80%
<i>and he asked me for a favor.</i>

00:25:06.056 --> 00:25:09.184 line:80%
Anything that a woman
in her twenties can use.

00:25:09.268 --> 00:25:11.020 line:80%
[Chan] <i>He wanted to get you a gift,</i>

00:25:11.103 --> 00:25:13.939 line:80%
<i>but he couldn't make time</i>
<i>because of his treatment.</i>

00:25:14.481 --> 00:25:15.899 line:80%
<i>He felt really sorry.</i>

00:25:15.983 --> 00:25:19.695 line:80%
[sighs, in English]
I'm looking for a pen, like…

00:25:20.738 --> 00:25:24.199 line:80%
A pen for efficient design sketches.
Do you have them?

00:25:24.783 --> 00:25:27.369 line:80%
[in Korean] <i>That's when</i>
<i>I remembered what you'd said.</i>

00:25:27.453 --> 00:25:31.623 line:80%
<i>You said you were surrounded by walls</i>
<i>and you couldn't sketch anything.</i>

00:25:31.707 --> 00:25:35.210 line:80%
<i>Hoping it would cheer you up a bit,</i>
<i>I chose a drawing pen.</i>

00:25:35.294 --> 00:25:36.879 line:80%
[in English] Okay, I'll take this.

00:25:37.671 --> 00:25:41.008 line:80%
Is it a gift?
I could engrave it if you'd like.

00:25:42.968 --> 00:25:43.969 line:80%
[sighs]

00:25:45.929 --> 00:25:47.056 line:80%
[Chan] <i>"Haran."</i>

00:25:47.640 --> 00:25:48.807 line:80%
[in Korean] <i>I suddenly remembered</i>

00:25:48.891 --> 00:25:52.603 line:80%
<i>the name Hyeokchan had said</i>
<i>when he was calling you.</i>

00:25:54.521 --> 00:25:56.982 line:80%
[Eunchan] <i>The design contest winner is…</i>

00:25:57.733 --> 00:25:59.485 line:80%
<i>Congratulations, Haran.</i>

00:25:59.568 --> 00:26:00.986 line:80%
YOU KNOW, YOU'RE MY SAVIOR.

00:26:02.237 --> 00:26:05.532 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Hyeokchan was away</i>
<i>to help our professor with some research.</i>

00:26:07.117 --> 00:26:10.079 line:80%
I'm traveling around the East Coast
during vacation.

00:26:10.162 --> 00:26:13.957 line:80%
If our professor asks for me,
say I'm taking a break because of my hand.

00:26:14.792 --> 00:26:16.710 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Our laptops got switched</i>
<i>by accident back then…</i>

00:26:16.794 --> 00:26:18.045 line:80%
[bracelet clinks]

00:26:18.128 --> 00:26:21.131 line:80%
<i>…and soon after,</i>
<i>I had another day where I felt trapped.</i>

00:26:21.799 --> 00:26:22.800 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:26:22.883 --> 00:26:25.469 line:80%
[Seok grunting angrily]

00:26:28.138 --> 00:26:30.057 line:80%
How long are you going to keep doing this?

00:26:30.140 --> 00:26:33.435 line:80%
What more do I have to do
to make you stop?

00:26:35.104 --> 00:26:37.231 line:80%
-[sobbing]
-[Chan] <i>Do you remember</i>

00:26:37.314 --> 00:26:41.235 line:80%
<i>how I said I stood alone</i>
<i>in a harsh winter as well?</i>

00:26:42.778 --> 00:26:46.156 line:80%
<i>I'd been barely holding on,</i>
<i>surrounded by walls,</i>

00:26:46.240 --> 00:26:49.076 line:80%
<i>but just as I was about to give up</i>
<i>and end everything…</i>

00:26:49.159 --> 00:26:50.160 line:80%
[laptop pinging]

00:26:50.244 --> 00:26:53.122 line:80%
<i>…you suddenly spoke to me</i>

00:26:53.914 --> 00:26:56.375 line:80%
<i>right when I was about to die.</i>

00:26:57.209 --> 00:26:58.335 line:80%
"You're…

00:26:59.461 --> 00:27:00.796 line:80%
my savior."

00:27:00.879 --> 00:27:03.340 line:80%
<i>I knew those words weren't meant for me,</i>

00:27:03.424 --> 00:27:06.135 line:80%
<i>but I wanted to cling to them.</i>

00:27:06.969 --> 00:27:08.929 line:80%
<i>You said I was your savior,</i>

00:27:09.513 --> 00:27:11.557 line:80%
<i>but you were the one who saved me.</i>

00:27:12.641 --> 00:27:13.642 line:80%
<i>And that…</i>

00:27:14.310 --> 00:27:15.978 line:80%
<i>gave me reason to keep living.</i>

00:27:16.603 --> 00:27:17.938 line:80%
<i>Song Haran.</i>

00:27:18.272 --> 00:27:19.982 line:80%
You saved me,

00:27:20.065 --> 00:27:21.150 line:80%
seven years ago.

00:27:22.109 --> 00:27:23.485 line:80%
You saved me back then!

00:27:24.194 --> 00:27:25.195 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:27:25.279 --> 00:27:27.114 line:80%
<i>-Since then…</i>
-[sighs heavily]

00:27:27.197 --> 00:27:29.450 line:80%
<i>…I couldn't ignore the messages you sent,</i>

00:27:30.075 --> 00:27:31.368 line:80%
<i>-thinking it was Hyeokchan.</i>
<i>-</i>[sniffles]

00:27:31.452 --> 00:27:33.996 line:80%
4. GOLDBERG, NEON ALIEN, SMELL OF RAIN
THE PERSON WHO BROADENED MY WORLD

00:27:34.079 --> 00:27:35.497 line:80%
[laptop pings]

00:27:35.581 --> 00:27:38.584 line:80%
[Haran] <i>That Gold-something that</i>
<i>helps you sleep. I heard there's no proof.</i>

00:27:38.667 --> 00:27:40.794 line:80%
<i>It's like music to wake you up.</i>

00:27:40.878 --> 00:27:43.047 line:80%
[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:27:43.130 --> 00:27:45.174 line:80%
-[chuckles]
-[Chan] <i>I'd forgotten how to smile,</i>

00:27:45.257 --> 00:27:47.426 line:80%
<i>but I started smiling because of you.</i>

00:27:47.926 --> 00:27:48.927 line:80%
[laptop pings]

00:27:49.678 --> 00:27:50.846 line:20%
[Haran] <i>Shocking news.</i>

00:27:50.929 --> 00:27:53.265 line:20%
<i>I was eating lunch,</i>
<i>and there was eggplant in it.</i>

00:27:53.349 --> 00:27:54.350 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Eggplant?</i>

00:27:54.433 --> 00:27:57.936 line:80%
[Haran] <i>It's all mushy and squishy,</i>
<i>and it's neon-colored. Yuck!</i>

00:27:58.020 --> 00:27:59.271 line:80%
<i>The taste of a neon alien.</i>

00:28:00.773 --> 00:28:01.940 line:80%
A neon alien…

00:28:02.358 --> 00:28:03.525 line:80%
<i>I grew curious about you...</i>

00:28:03.609 --> 00:28:04.610 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:28:04.693 --> 00:28:05.944 line:80%
<i>...and started looking forward</i>

00:28:06.820 --> 00:28:08.947 line:80%
<i>to what interesting stories</i>
<i>you'd tell me next.</i>

00:28:11.075 --> 00:28:14.536 line:80%
<i>My black-and-white life</i>
<i>began to be filled with colors,</i>

00:28:14.620 --> 00:28:16.622 line:80%
<i>and my tiny world</i>

00:28:17.623 --> 00:28:18.957 line:80%
<i>began to grow bigger,</i>

00:28:19.416 --> 00:28:22.127 line:80%
<i>thanks to your messages.</i>

00:28:23.128 --> 00:28:26.131 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Thank you for helping me</i>
<i>not give up on what I love.</i>

00:28:26.632 --> 00:28:28.425 line:80%
<i>For giving me a reason to keep going.</i>

00:28:30.260 --> 00:28:34.390 line:20%
[Chan] <i>If there was just a small crack</i>
<i>to breathe through, I could live.</i>

00:28:35.015 --> 00:28:39.228 line:80%
<i>I guess I wanted that pen</i>
<i>to be that "if" for you.</i>

00:28:41.563 --> 00:28:44.024 line:80%
<i>You became that "if" for me,</i>

00:28:45.025 --> 00:28:47.903 line:80%
<i>because I started drawing again,</i>
<i>thanks to you.</i>

00:28:49.738 --> 00:28:50.739 line:80%
[in English] Hey, Chan.

00:28:51.240 --> 00:28:52.825 line:80%
Got the dorm maintenance notice.

00:28:52.908 --> 00:28:54.118 line:80%
Thank you.

00:28:55.202 --> 00:28:56.495 line:80%
Wow, you're really good.

00:28:56.578 --> 00:28:58.580 line:80%
You think you can draw me one day?

00:28:58.664 --> 00:29:01.041 line:80%
Uh… [hesitates] Okay.

00:29:01.125 --> 00:29:03.377 line:80%
-Ah. Good, thanks.
-[Chan in Korean] <i>And…</i>

00:29:03.460 --> 00:29:06.380 line:80%
<i>for the first time,</i>
<i>I started looking forward to the next day.</i>

00:29:06.463 --> 00:29:09.091 line:80%
<i>The moments I spent talking to you</i>

00:29:09.174 --> 00:29:12.845 line:80%
<i>helped me stay strong</i>
<i>without crumbling down.</i>

00:29:15.139 --> 00:29:16.140 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:29:16.682 --> 00:29:17.683 line:80%
5. THE EXPLOSION

00:29:17.766 --> 00:29:18.767 line:80%
<i>But…</i>

00:29:18.851 --> 00:29:22.938 line:80%
<i>near the end of that summer,</i>
<i>there was an accident.</i>

00:29:23.022 --> 00:29:24.189 line:80%
<i>A lab explosion.</i>

00:29:26.650 --> 00:29:29.987 line:80%
<i>Everyone said I'd die soon</i>
<i>and that I would never wake up.</i>

00:29:30.070 --> 00:29:31.071 line:80%
<i>But…</i>

00:29:31.155 --> 00:29:32.197 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Chan.</i>

00:29:32.489 --> 00:29:33.490 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I heard a voice.</i>

00:29:33.574 --> 00:29:34.867 line:80%
[Haran] <i>I love you.</i>

00:29:34.950 --> 00:29:36.035 line:80%
[monitor beeping rapidly]

00:29:36.118 --> 00:29:37.494 line:80%
I love you, Chan.

00:29:37.578 --> 00:29:40.914 line:80%
[Chan] <i>It was as if that voice</i>
<i>was trying to wake me up.</i>

00:29:41.415 --> 00:29:42.499 line:80%
[♪ somber music playing]

00:29:42.583 --> 00:29:44.585 line:80%
<i>I woke to that voice,</i>

00:29:46.128 --> 00:29:47.421 line:80%
<i>but I couldn't remember</i>

00:29:48.047 --> 00:29:50.716 line:80%
<i>who called my name and woke me up.</i>

00:29:51.967 --> 00:29:53.135 line:80%
[sighs]

00:29:53.218 --> 00:29:55.763 line:80%
<i>I lost my memories after the accident</i>
<i>for about a year,</i>

00:29:56.764 --> 00:29:59.099 line:80%
<i>but for some reason,</i>

00:29:59.892 --> 00:30:01.435 line:80%
<i>that person's face and voice</i>

00:30:02.019 --> 00:30:06.023 line:80%
<i>kept popping up vividly in my mind.</i>

00:30:06.815 --> 00:30:10.319 line:80%
<i>And when I came to Korea for treatment,</i>
<i>I spotted her by coincidence.</i>

00:30:11.362 --> 00:30:12.613 line:80%
<i>On Christmas Eve,</i>

00:30:13.322 --> 00:30:14.615 line:80%
<i>at Jamsugyo.</i>

00:30:15.240 --> 00:30:16.700 line:80%
<i>I ran after her,</i>

00:30:16.784 --> 00:30:19.912 line:80%
<i>thinking she'd be the one</i>
<i>holding the key to my memories.</i>

00:30:20.746 --> 00:30:23.207 line:80%
[crackling]

00:30:23.290 --> 00:30:26.877 line:80%
<i>But fireworks suddenly went off,</i>
<i>and I remembered the explosion.</i>

00:30:27.294 --> 00:30:28.754 line:80%
<i>All my hazy memories</i>

00:30:28.837 --> 00:30:31.173 line:80%
<i>came flooding back.</i>

00:30:32.800 --> 00:30:33.926 line:80%
<i>That's when I realized</i>

00:30:34.718 --> 00:30:38.347 line:80%
<i>that person</i>
<i>was my old roommate's girlfriend,</i>

00:30:39.098 --> 00:30:40.224 line:80%
<i>and that I was just…</i>

00:30:41.183 --> 00:30:45.688 line:80%
<i>a complete stranger to you.</i>

00:30:45.771 --> 00:30:47.189 line:80%
[♪ music swells]

00:30:51.694 --> 00:30:52.945 line:80%
6. MEMENTO MORI

00:30:53.028 --> 00:30:55.280 line:20%
<i>I immediately left</i>
<i>without a clear destination.</i>

00:30:55.364 --> 00:30:56.907 line:80%
<i>I wanted to get rid of my past.</i>

00:30:56.991 --> 00:30:58.951 line:80%
I'd like a ticket
for the earliest departure anywhere.

00:30:59.034 --> 00:31:02.246 line:80%
<i>But there was one thing</i>
<i>I just couldn't get rid of.</i>

00:31:05.416 --> 00:31:08.127 line:80%
<i>There was someone</i>
<i>who had helped me survive twice.</i>

00:31:08.210 --> 00:31:09.211 line:80%
DRAW

00:31:09.294 --> 00:31:10.879 line:80%
<i>At least for her sake,</i>

00:31:10.963 --> 00:31:13.632 line:80%
<i>I knew I had to stop</i>
<i>living like a dead person.</i>

00:31:14.216 --> 00:31:17.761 line:80%
<i>I got this tattoo</i>
<i>so I wouldn't forget that resolution.</i>

00:31:18.345 --> 00:31:19.638 line:80%
<i>"Memento Mori."</i>

00:31:20.431 --> 00:31:21.432 line:80%
[clicking]

00:31:22.099 --> 00:31:26.937 line:80%
<i>So I struggled for seven years</i>
<i>like I was trying to become someone else,</i>

00:31:27.479 --> 00:31:28.897 line:80%
<i>and at some point,</i>

00:31:28.981 --> 00:31:31.900 line:80%
<i>my environment, surroundings, and I…</i>

00:31:31.984 --> 00:31:33.861 line:80%
<i>had really changed.</i>

00:31:34.653 --> 00:31:37.489 line:80%
<i>-It was as if my past did not matter.</i>
<i>-</i>[birds chirping]

00:31:37.573 --> 00:31:38.907 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:31:38.991 --> 00:31:41.243 line:80%
7. NICE TO MEET YOU

00:31:42.494 --> 00:31:45.998 line:80%
<i>Then one day, you appeared again</i>

00:31:46.081 --> 00:31:49.043 line:80%
<i>right in front of me, after seven years.</i>

00:31:49.126 --> 00:31:50.377 line:80%
It's nice to meet you.

00:31:50.461 --> 00:31:52.588 line:80%
I'm Song Haran, the lead designer.

00:31:52.671 --> 00:31:54.965 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I thought I was going to cry.</i>

00:31:55.049 --> 00:31:58.552 line:80%
<i>I was so grateful, and I missed you</i>
<i>and was curious about you, but…</i>

00:31:58.635 --> 00:32:00.637 line:80%
It's nice to meet you. I'm…

00:32:01.305 --> 00:32:04.224 line:80%
<i>You were someone</i>
<i>I shouldn't even think about.</i>

00:32:04.308 --> 00:32:05.643 line:80%
…Seonu Chan.

00:32:05.726 --> 00:32:07.186 line:80%
8. LET'S HAVE FUN LIKE A SPRING PICNIC

00:32:07.269 --> 00:32:08.270 line:80%
[♪ gentle music playing]

00:32:08.354 --> 00:32:10.314 line:80%
If anything happens to you too…

00:32:10.397 --> 00:32:11.398 line:80%
Haran.

00:32:12.066 --> 00:32:15.944 line:80%
[Chan] <i>At first, I decided to avoid you</i>
<i>so I wouldn't get caught,</i>

00:32:17.696 --> 00:32:19.198 line:80%
<i>but I felt pained</i>

00:32:20.240 --> 00:32:21.241 line:80%
<i>while watching you.</i>

00:32:22.910 --> 00:32:26.580 line:80%
<i>The person who saved me seven years ago</i>
<i>was trapped alone in winter.</i>

00:32:28.624 --> 00:32:30.209 line:80%
<i>I thought I'd regret it later…</i>

00:32:30.292 --> 00:32:32.378 line:80%
It's really valuable to me,
so I have to find it.

00:32:32.461 --> 00:32:34.213 line:80%
[Chan] <i>So I ended up making a crazy offer.</i>

00:32:35.172 --> 00:32:36.382 line:80%
A three-month trial!

00:32:36.465 --> 00:32:38.050 line:80%
Then let's do this.

00:32:38.133 --> 00:32:39.927 line:80%
It'll be like we're on a spring picnic.

00:32:40.678 --> 00:32:41.679 line:80%
Let's have fun.

00:32:50.145 --> 00:32:51.146 line:80%
[sighs]

00:32:51.230 --> 00:32:52.856 line:80%
9. GREED

00:32:52.940 --> 00:32:56.235 line:80%
<i>Many things happened between us</i>
<i>after that.</i>

00:32:56.318 --> 00:32:58.362 line:80%
-[honk echoes]
-[Haran exclaims in panic]

00:32:58.445 --> 00:32:59.446 line:80%
[tires screech]

00:33:00.114 --> 00:33:01.824 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:33:03.826 --> 00:33:06.245 line:80%
[Chan sighs] Tell me if it keeps hurting.

00:33:06.328 --> 00:33:07.913 line:80%
I'll carry you if I have to.

00:33:08.414 --> 00:33:09.456 line:80%
Ms. Song!

00:33:12.126 --> 00:33:13.460 line:80%
How have you been?

00:33:18.465 --> 00:33:19.758 line:80%
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:33:29.893 --> 00:33:31.979 line:80%
<i>I ended up liking you so much,</i>

00:33:32.062 --> 00:33:35.316 line:80%
<i>even when</i>
<i>I couldn't explain myself to you.</i>

00:33:39.695 --> 00:33:40.696 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:33:41.655 --> 00:33:44.825 line:80%
10. MY BIRTHDAY, THE DAY I DECIDED
TO EXPLAIN MYSELF DESPITE THE GAPS

00:33:44.908 --> 00:33:46.201 line:80%
[♪ sentimental music playing]

00:33:46.285 --> 00:33:49.288 line:80%
I feel like
telling you everything today, too.

00:33:49.371 --> 00:33:52.207 line:80%
I think I should stop
hiding things about myself.

00:33:52.291 --> 00:33:53.334 line:80%
Odd or even?

00:33:53.417 --> 00:33:55.753 line:80%
<i>-I wanted to tell you everything…</i>
-Odd.

00:33:56.253 --> 00:33:57.379 line:80%
[Chan exclaims]

00:33:57.463 --> 00:33:59.923 line:80%
<i>But I knew my memories</i>
<i>weren't fully intact.</i>

00:34:00.007 --> 00:34:01.008 line:80%
[bracelet clinks]

00:34:01.091 --> 00:34:02.968 line:80%
<i>I grew worried that acting rashly</i>

00:34:04.511 --> 00:34:08.182 line:80%
<i>would ruin things between us</i>
<i>or hurt you in some way.</i>

00:34:08.641 --> 00:34:09.892 line:80%
And in spring…

00:34:10.476 --> 00:34:12.478 line:80%
Will you not be here in spring?

00:34:13.228 --> 00:34:17.399 line:80%
I'm going to use that trial
for the rest of my life.

00:34:17.483 --> 00:34:18.525 line:80%
[Chan] <i>But…</i>

00:34:18.609 --> 00:34:20.110 line:80%
<i>I felt frustrated</i>

00:34:20.194 --> 00:34:23.489 line:80%
<i>that I couldn't talk about the future</i>
<i>with the person I loved.</i>

00:34:24.406 --> 00:34:26.825 line:80%
<i>So I made a decision.</i>

00:34:27.201 --> 00:34:31.246 line:80%
<i>I decided I'd slowly explain</i>
<i>what I could remember.</i>

00:34:31.330 --> 00:34:34.124 line:80%
Do you have time after the movie?

00:34:34.541 --> 00:34:36.335 line:80%
There's something I have to tell you.

00:34:37.419 --> 00:34:39.630 line:80%
<i>I knew you would see</i>

00:34:40.506 --> 00:34:41.882 line:80%
<i>how sincere I was.</i>

00:34:47.096 --> 00:34:48.347 line:80%
-[sniffing]
<i>-I wanted to show you</i>

00:34:48.973 --> 00:34:50.683 line:80%
<i>-that there's another way.</i>
-[sighs]

00:34:51.392 --> 00:34:53.602 line:80%
I learned it through that person.

00:34:53.686 --> 00:34:56.689 line:80%
She was just
someone who broadened my world.

00:34:56.772 --> 00:34:58.732 line:80%
You felt like someone you miss

00:34:59.566 --> 00:35:01.402 line:80%
called your name.

00:35:01.485 --> 00:35:04.989 line:80%
You already did that for me.

00:35:06.991 --> 00:35:08.492 line:80%
[sobbing]

00:35:09.827 --> 00:35:13.080 line:80%
[Chan] I thought it would be impossible,
so I scribbled it out…

00:35:18.544 --> 00:35:19.962 line:80%
but it might be possible now.

00:35:20.045 --> 00:35:21.588 line:80%
[sobbing]

00:35:22.715 --> 00:35:24.174 line:80%
[Sujin] <i>He went traveling with me.</i>

00:35:24.258 --> 00:35:27.302 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Hyeokchan was away during vacation</i>
<i>to help our professor.</i>

00:35:27.386 --> 00:35:29.179 line:80%
<i>He asked me for a favor.</i>

00:35:32.516 --> 00:35:34.018 line:80%
I chose to never do anything

00:35:34.101 --> 00:35:37.354 line:80%
that might get in the way
of her happiness.

00:35:37.438 --> 00:35:39.898 line:80%
Thanks to you, I just realized

00:35:39.982 --> 00:35:43.777 line:80%
that not digging up old wounds
is also a way

00:35:45.279 --> 00:35:47.656 line:80%
of protecting their happiness.

00:35:48.240 --> 00:35:49.700 line:80%
[crying]

00:35:49.783 --> 00:35:50.909 line:80%
That was all about me.

00:35:56.040 --> 00:35:58.042 line:80%
[Haran bawling]

00:35:59.960 --> 00:36:02.004 line:80%
I should've heard him out.

00:36:02.796 --> 00:36:04.673 line:80%
I should've listened to him just once.

00:36:18.437 --> 00:36:19.647 line:80%
[♪ music ends]

00:36:22.107 --> 00:36:23.442 line:80%
-[Nana] Is this okay?
-[Hadam] Let me see.

00:36:23.942 --> 00:36:25.569 line:80%
-Good.
-[hums excitedly]

00:36:27.446 --> 00:36:29.073 line:80%
Your discharge is complete.

00:36:29.156 --> 00:36:30.407 line:80%
Congratulations.

00:36:30.491 --> 00:36:31.575 line:80%
-Great.
-Let's go.

00:36:33.869 --> 00:36:35.621 line:80%
-[Hayeong squeals] Mr. Park is here.
-Ta-da.

00:36:35.704 --> 00:36:36.705 line:80%
[Manjae] Here.

00:36:36.789 --> 00:36:39.583 line:80%
-He's here.
-Congratulations on your discharge.

00:36:39.667 --> 00:36:41.085 line:80%
They're beautiful.

00:36:41.543 --> 00:36:44.254 line:80%
Let me give you a ride back.
I'll drop you off at SHIM.

00:36:44.338 --> 00:36:46.799 line:80%
Manjae. Should we walk back?

00:36:47.758 --> 00:36:49.176 line:80%
I want to take a walk.

00:36:49.259 --> 00:36:52.846 line:80%
I want to breathe in the cold air
and the smell of winter.

00:36:52.930 --> 00:36:54.473 line:80%
You'll catch a cold outside.

00:36:54.556 --> 00:36:55.641 line:80%
Just take our car.

00:36:55.724 --> 00:36:57.768 line:80%
They're right. You should get some rest.

00:36:57.851 --> 00:36:59.812 line:80%
[chuckles] A winter walk?

00:36:59.895 --> 00:37:02.731 line:80%
That sounds amazing.

00:37:02.815 --> 00:37:04.441 line:80%
[all chuckle]

00:37:05.234 --> 00:37:07.236 line:80%
[♪ heartwarming song playing]

00:37:15.077 --> 00:37:16.078 line:80%
[Nana] <i>It's amazing.</i>

00:37:17.371 --> 00:37:21.709 line:80%
I thought walking and breathing

00:37:21.792 --> 00:37:23.877 line:80%
were just natural things in life,

00:37:26.046 --> 00:37:27.047 line:80%
but today,

00:37:28.132 --> 00:37:29.299 line:80%
it all feels like a gift.

00:37:32.678 --> 00:37:34.013 line:80%
I realized that too late.

00:37:35.973 --> 00:37:37.891 line:80%
Seeing such a beautiful sunset

00:37:39.226 --> 00:37:40.602 line:80%
and feeling the seasons…

00:37:41.854 --> 00:37:43.063 line:80%
I could have always

00:37:44.023 --> 00:37:45.024 line:80%
lived…

00:37:46.317 --> 00:37:48.444 line:80%
like life was a gift if I wanted to.

00:37:48.527 --> 00:37:50.404 line:80%
It's not late at all.

00:37:50.487 --> 00:37:51.488 line:80%
From now on,

00:37:52.781 --> 00:37:55.534 line:80%
we can do it all together,
little by little.

00:38:03.667 --> 00:38:04.918 line:80%
[Haran] <i>In the meantime,</i>

00:38:05.002 --> 00:38:08.505 line:80%
<i>we went through big and small changes.</i>

00:38:08.589 --> 00:38:09.631 line:80%
No need to hurry.

00:38:09.715 --> 00:38:10.924 line:80%
-One at a time.
-Slowly…

00:38:11.759 --> 00:38:12.926 line:80%
Good job.

00:38:13.010 --> 00:38:14.053 line:80%
Almost there.

00:38:18.140 --> 00:38:19.183 line:80%
Yougyum.

00:38:20.059 --> 00:38:21.310 line:80%
What is it, Hadam?

00:38:21.393 --> 00:38:22.394 line:80%
[♪ music ends]

00:38:25.147 --> 00:38:26.857 line:80%
"Congratulations, you've been…"

00:38:26.940 --> 00:38:29.068 line:80%
[♪ lighthearted music playing]

00:38:29.151 --> 00:38:32.071 line:80%
-Hadam!
-I'm a real med student now!

00:38:32.571 --> 00:38:34.198 line:80%
Great job, Hadam.

00:38:34.281 --> 00:38:35.824 line:80%
I can't believe it.

00:38:35.908 --> 00:38:38.243 line:80%
Yougyum, what's going on?
Why are you jumping?

00:38:38.327 --> 00:38:41.288 line:80%
[clears throat] Hadam's a med student now.

00:38:41.372 --> 00:38:43.624 line:80%
-She just got accepted.
-[giggles]

00:38:43.707 --> 00:38:45.292 line:80%
[crying]

00:38:47.086 --> 00:38:49.755 line:80%
Hey. Why are you crying?

00:38:49.838 --> 00:38:51.173 line:80%
You're not her boyfriend.

00:38:51.256 --> 00:38:52.925 line:80%
[Changmo] I just got a call from the team.

00:38:53.008 --> 00:38:55.761 line:80%
I thought it was over
after I went undrafted,

00:38:56.303 --> 00:38:58.347 line:80%
but I got picked up by the Taesan Titans.

00:38:59.181 --> 00:39:00.766 line:80%
I'm going pro!

00:39:00.849 --> 00:39:02.434 line:80%
-Wow.
-Hey.

00:39:02.518 --> 00:39:03.686 line:80%
Yang Changmo!

00:39:03.769 --> 00:39:05.104 line:80%
[all cheering]

00:39:06.730 --> 00:39:07.731 line:80%
Hang on.

00:39:08.357 --> 00:39:10.234 line:80%
Hey, how am I jumping?

00:39:11.735 --> 00:39:13.445 line:80%
Oh? It doesn't hurt.

00:39:13.529 --> 00:39:14.530 line:80%
Really?

00:39:15.030 --> 00:39:16.198 line:80%
It really doesn't hurt?

00:39:16.281 --> 00:39:17.533 line:80%
No, not at all.

00:39:18.450 --> 00:39:21.704 line:80%
-[all exclaiming excitedly]
-It doesn't hurt!

00:39:21.787 --> 00:39:22.997 line:80%
[therapist] Sir! Mr. Cha!

00:39:23.580 --> 00:39:24.915 line:80%
You shouldn't jump yet.

00:39:24.999 --> 00:39:26.583 line:80%
[all] Sorry.

00:39:29.336 --> 00:39:31.672 line:80%
[exclaiming, giggling]

00:39:33.716 --> 00:39:34.717 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:39:37.177 --> 00:39:38.178 line:80%
Are you heading out?

00:39:39.096 --> 00:39:41.348 line:80%
Yes, I'm heading out.

00:39:45.728 --> 00:39:49.273 line:80%
<i>He said he has feelings for me.</i>

00:39:49.356 --> 00:39:52.568 line:80%
<i>He asked if he could like me,</i>
<i>and I said yes.</i>

00:39:52.651 --> 00:39:54.862 line:80%
<i>But he's exactly the same as before…</i>

00:39:54.945 --> 00:39:57.614 line:80%
If you're free,
would you like to have some wine?

00:39:59.033 --> 00:40:01.618 line:80%
-[♪ heart-fluttering music playing]
-Just the two of us.

00:40:01.702 --> 00:40:04.330 line:80%
Just the two of us?

00:40:07.082 --> 00:40:08.459 line:80%
[stutters] All right.

00:40:08.542 --> 00:40:10.878 line:80%
[clears throat] Sounds good.

00:40:18.927 --> 00:40:19.970 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:40:22.056 --> 00:40:23.098 line:80%
[Nana] What is this?

00:40:23.182 --> 00:40:25.934 line:80%
You just got surgery.
You need to regain your strength.

00:40:26.018 --> 00:40:29.647 line:80%
It's a local specialty from Jeju,
made by a master artisan. They're tasty.

00:40:29.730 --> 00:40:31.607 line:80%
-Mmm.
-Have them with your granddaughters.

00:40:31.690 --> 00:40:33.567 line:80%
-They look delicious. Manjae.
-Yes?

00:40:33.651 --> 00:40:34.985 line:80%
You should have some too.

00:40:35.569 --> 00:40:37.571 line:80%
[♪ whimsical music playing]

00:40:39.031 --> 00:40:42.451 line:80%
All right. They look delicious.

00:40:42.534 --> 00:40:43.994 line:80%
[in English] Okay.

00:40:44.078 --> 00:40:45.454 line:80%
-[in Korean] Eat up.
-[Nana] Okay.

00:40:45.579 --> 00:40:47.039 line:80%
Focus on recovering.

00:40:47.122 --> 00:40:49.166 line:80%
-You should eat too.
-All right.

00:40:49.249 --> 00:40:50.584 line:80%
-[Nana] Here.
-[Manjae] Eat up, everyone.

00:40:50.668 --> 00:40:52.419 line:80%
[sisters] Thank you.

00:40:55.422 --> 00:40:56.423 line:80%
[Manjae] Goodness.

00:40:56.507 --> 00:40:59.051 line:80%
Mmm! They're so chewy.

00:40:59.134 --> 00:41:00.594 line:80%
-[Manjae] Good.
-They're so tasty.

00:41:00.678 --> 00:41:02.054 line:80%
This is good.

00:41:02.930 --> 00:41:04.348 line:80%
-Mmm. It's delicious.
-[♪ music ends]

00:41:04.431 --> 00:41:06.475 line:80%
[Hadam] "This was the email
from the Comets."

00:41:06.558 --> 00:41:09.311 line:80%
"We watched the medical test video."

00:41:09.395 --> 00:41:11.271 line:80%
"We would like to verify

00:41:11.355 --> 00:41:14.233 line:80%
his rehabilitation progress
and other aspects besides the video,

00:41:14.316 --> 00:41:17.152 line:80%
so we suggest conducting a final test

00:41:17.236 --> 00:41:21.073 line:80%
at a local training center
as soon as possible."

00:41:21.949 --> 00:41:22.950 line:80%
What?

00:41:23.033 --> 00:41:24.910 line:80%
You have to go to the States for the test?

00:41:24.994 --> 00:41:27.788 line:80%
They must be worried because of my injury.

00:41:28.998 --> 00:41:31.000 line:80%
I'll go and try my best until the end.

00:41:31.500 --> 00:41:34.086 line:80%
As you said, if I give up
without trying until the end,

00:41:34.169 --> 00:41:36.213 line:80%
all that will be left is regret.

00:41:36.296 --> 00:41:37.297 line:80%
All right.

00:41:37.756 --> 00:41:40.759 line:80%
Go and show them everything you've got,

00:41:40.843 --> 00:41:41.969 line:80%
and leave no regrets.

00:41:45.764 --> 00:41:46.807 line:80%
Let's do this!

00:41:47.308 --> 00:41:48.309 line:80%
Let's do this!

00:41:48.934 --> 00:41:49.935 line:80%
Gather our strength.

00:41:50.561 --> 00:41:53.230 line:80%
-[Haran] <i>After many things happened…</i>
-You can do it, right?

00:41:53.314 --> 00:41:54.523 line:80%
<i>…during fall and winter,</i>

00:41:55.190 --> 00:41:57.693 line:80%
<i>the seasons passed…</i>

00:41:58.152 --> 00:42:00.279 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional song playing]

00:42:01.071 --> 00:42:02.614 line:80%
It really is spring.

00:42:03.449 --> 00:42:05.034 line:80%
<i>-And winter began to meet...</i>
<i>-</i>[sighs]

00:42:05.117 --> 00:42:07.453 line:80%
<i>...the beginning of spring.</i>

00:42:09.788 --> 00:42:14.585 line:80%
<i>However, the man who offered</i>
<i>a fun spring picnic</i>

00:42:14.668 --> 00:42:18.255 line:80%
<i>was nowhere to be found in spring.</i>

00:42:18.339 --> 00:42:20.424 line:80%
-I really wanted something cold.
-Wow.

00:42:20.507 --> 00:42:22.551 line:80%
[Hayeong] This is heaven.
It's so hot outside.

00:42:22.634 --> 00:42:23.635 line:80%
Here.

00:42:23.719 --> 00:42:25.512 line:80%
-[Raemee] Thank you.
-[Seunggyu] This is insane.

00:42:28.474 --> 00:42:30.517 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Let's go see</i>
<i>the cherry blossoms in spring.</i>

00:42:31.018 --> 00:42:32.227 line:80%
We'll have…

00:42:33.854 --> 00:42:35.439 line:80%
shaved ice in summer.

00:42:36.649 --> 00:42:37.900 line:80%
[Seunggyu] Have some, Ms. Song.

00:42:37.983 --> 00:42:39.193 line:80%
Come and have one.

00:42:39.276 --> 00:42:41.362 line:80%
I'm okay. Enjoy.

00:42:41.445 --> 00:42:44.114 line:80%
<i>Even as another season passed,</i>

00:42:44.198 --> 00:42:46.575 line:80%
<i>there was still no news from him.</i>

00:42:47.743 --> 00:42:49.161 line:80%
[♪ song continues]

00:43:00.547 --> 00:43:05.094 line:80%
GERANIUM
MEANING: I CAN'T STOP THINKING OF YOU

00:43:29.034 --> 00:43:30.160 line:80%
[Sol] It's that cloud, right?

00:43:30.244 --> 00:43:32.371 line:80%
The one that Ms. Song saw in Gyeongju

00:43:32.454 --> 00:43:35.332 line:80%
that was the inspiration for Won's outfit.

00:43:35.416 --> 00:43:36.500 line:80%
What was it called?

00:43:36.583 --> 00:43:38.627 line:80%
-An iridescent cloud.
-[Sol] That's right.

00:43:40.045 --> 00:43:41.880 line:80%
It's called an iridescent cloud.

00:43:41.964 --> 00:43:44.466 line:80%
They say you have good luck
if you see an iridescent cloud.

00:43:45.926 --> 00:43:47.261 line:80%
[Seunggyu] Come to think of it,

00:43:47.344 --> 00:43:50.306 line:80%
it's already been a year
since we went to Gyeongju.

00:43:50.389 --> 00:43:51.432 line:80%
[Raemee] I uploaded it.

00:43:51.515 --> 00:43:53.726 line:80%
Everyone, like my post.

00:43:53.809 --> 00:43:57.354 line:80%
Hey, Song Haran.
I'm not letting you slip away quietly.

00:43:58.772 --> 00:44:00.316 line:80%
Give me a like on my feed.

00:44:17.291 --> 00:44:18.876 line:80%
[Chan] Here's a lucky charm.

00:44:19.543 --> 00:44:22.421 line:80%
You know you'll get lucky
once you see an iridescent cloud.

00:44:26.383 --> 00:44:30.471 line:80%
WE'RE USING THE DRAWING YOU GIFTED US
FOR OUR WEDDING INVITES!

00:44:30.554 --> 00:44:32.556 line:80%
[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:44:33.223 --> 00:44:35.893 line:80%
IRIDESCENT CLOUD ARTIST

00:44:41.148 --> 00:44:44.318 line:20%
I JUST GOT A SURPRISE DRAWING GIFT
THANK YOU FOR THE GREAT MEMORY!

00:44:44.401 --> 00:44:46.945 line:80%
"Gangneung, 16 minutes…"

00:44:47.029 --> 00:44:48.238 line:80%
16 MINUTES AGO

00:44:48.322 --> 00:44:49.531 line:80%
I…

00:44:49.615 --> 00:44:52.660 line:80%
I… I'm taking the afternoon off.

00:44:52.743 --> 00:44:53.911 line:80%
That's so sudden.

00:44:54.703 --> 00:44:55.704 line:80%
What?

00:44:56.497 --> 00:44:57.581 line:80%
She just got here, though.

00:44:57.665 --> 00:44:59.083 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:45:10.344 --> 00:45:11.387 line:80%
[Chan] Hello.

00:45:11.970 --> 00:45:14.682 line:80%
You looked so happy,
so I drew a picture of you.

00:45:15.182 --> 00:45:16.266 line:80%
Can I gift it to you?

00:45:18.644 --> 00:45:20.229 line:80%
-You're giving this to us?
-[Chan] Yes.

00:45:20.312 --> 00:45:21.313 line:80%
Thank you.

00:45:23.482 --> 00:45:24.733 line:80%
But what's this cloud?

00:45:25.442 --> 00:45:26.902 line:80%
It's an iridescent cloud.

00:45:26.986 --> 00:45:28.821 line:80%
They say it gives you good luck.

00:45:28.904 --> 00:45:30.864 line:80%
I wanted to wish you fortune.

00:45:30.948 --> 00:45:32.408 line:80%
Enjoy your trip.

00:45:33.158 --> 00:45:34.535 line:80%
Thank you.

00:45:36.120 --> 00:45:37.955 line:80%
-[mother] You're here.
-[girl chuckles]

00:45:38.414 --> 00:45:39.456 line:80%
[father] It's so pretty.

00:45:58.809 --> 00:45:59.810 line:80%
[Haran sighs]

00:46:00.436 --> 00:46:02.062 line:20%
This is your sign, right?

00:46:02.146 --> 00:46:06.275 line:80%
Have you seen anyone nearby
who draws pictures like this?

00:46:06.358 --> 00:46:07.401 line:80%
I'm not sure.

00:46:07.484 --> 00:46:09.695 line:80%
Have you seen anyone
who draws pictures like this?

00:46:09.778 --> 00:46:10.779 line:80%
No.

00:46:10.863 --> 00:46:14.992 line:80%
Hello, have you seen
an artist drawing pictures nearby?

00:46:15.075 --> 00:46:16.118 line:80%
[man] No.

00:46:17.911 --> 00:46:19.663 line:80%
[Haran] Excuse me,
can I ask you something?

00:46:19.747 --> 00:46:23.125 line:80%
Have you seen an artist
who draws pictures with a cloud like this?

00:46:23.208 --> 00:46:24.585 line:80%
We received one earlier.

00:46:24.668 --> 00:46:26.086 line:80%
Isn't it this cloud?

00:46:26.170 --> 00:46:28.839 line:80%
[gasps softly] When did you see him?

00:46:28.922 --> 00:46:30.132 line:80%
Just earlier today.

00:46:30.215 --> 00:46:31.967 line:80%
-Four or five hours ago.
-Okay.

00:46:32.801 --> 00:46:34.928 line:80%
[exclaims softly] Thank you.

00:46:36.555 --> 00:46:37.556 line:80%
[sighs]

00:46:37.640 --> 00:46:39.058 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:46:58.118 --> 00:46:59.119 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:47:02.790 --> 00:47:04.958 line:80%
[sighs] Where on earth did he go?

00:47:13.384 --> 00:47:15.761 line:80%
-[♪ music fades]
-[camera shutter clicks]

00:47:17.054 --> 00:47:18.097 line:80%
[camera shutter clicks]

00:47:18.180 --> 00:47:19.181 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:47:19.765 --> 00:47:21.016 line:80%
Mmm.

00:47:21.684 --> 00:47:22.685 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:47:26.230 --> 00:47:27.773 line:80%
-Hello.
-[passerby] Hello.

00:47:27.856 --> 00:47:29.066 line:80%
What a cool dog.

00:47:29.149 --> 00:47:30.776 line:80%
-Can I pet it?
-Sure.

00:47:32.194 --> 00:47:33.654 line:80%
[Chan] Hi.

00:47:33.737 --> 00:47:35.906 line:80%
I was close to a dog
that looked just like this one.

00:47:35.990 --> 00:47:36.991 line:80%
[passerby] Really?

00:47:38.117 --> 00:47:39.118 line:80%
[Chan] Bye.

00:47:39.994 --> 00:47:41.036 line:80%
[passerby] Bye.

00:48:05.561 --> 00:48:06.770 line:80%
[Haran] Sorry.

00:48:08.105 --> 00:48:09.982 line:80%
I dropped my pen…

00:48:11.108 --> 00:48:12.192 line:80%
again.

00:48:15.612 --> 00:48:17.614 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:48:33.422 --> 00:48:34.423 line:80%
I found you.

00:48:36.925 --> 00:48:38.093 line:80%
[sighs]

00:48:39.345 --> 00:48:40.971 line:80%
I found you, Seonu Chan.

00:48:42.431 --> 00:48:43.432 line:80%
Why?

00:48:43.515 --> 00:48:45.559 line:80%
[crying] Why were you here alone?

00:48:49.938 --> 00:48:52.358 line:80%
I'm sorry, I realized too late.

00:48:55.110 --> 00:48:57.321 line:80%
Thank you for lying for me.

00:48:59.365 --> 00:49:02.076 line:80%
Thank you for protecting my scars.

00:49:04.703 --> 00:49:06.914 line:80%
No, it's all my fault.

00:49:06.997 --> 00:49:09.583 line:80%
I wasn't the only one
who didn't know what happened.

00:49:10.292 --> 00:49:12.503 line:80%
There are things you didn't know, either.

00:49:13.504 --> 00:49:14.588 line:80%
It's all my fault.

00:49:15.339 --> 00:49:17.591 line:80%
-I was being greedy--
-[Haran] No.

00:49:18.217 --> 00:49:20.052 line:80%
You didn't cause that accident.

00:49:21.053 --> 00:49:22.763 line:80%
Dr. Cha told me everything.

00:49:24.640 --> 00:49:27.518 line:80%
Seonu Chan disappeared because of me.

00:49:27.601 --> 00:49:28.978 line:80%
It was Hyeokchan

00:49:30.020 --> 00:49:31.397 line:80%
who caused the explosion.

00:49:33.649 --> 00:49:35.442 line:80%
And Seonu Chan was just a victim.

00:49:36.485 --> 00:49:37.695 line:80%
I lied to him.

00:49:39.029 --> 00:49:42.282 line:80%
I wanted to protect Hyeokchan
in any way I could.

00:49:43.033 --> 00:49:44.410 line:80%
[♪ foreboding music playing]

00:49:44.493 --> 00:49:45.494 line:80%
[shudders]

00:49:46.453 --> 00:49:48.288 line:80%
I'm sorry, it was me--

00:49:48.372 --> 00:49:49.999 line:80%
It was caused by his lighter.

00:49:50.708 --> 00:49:53.085 line:80%
It happened because Hyeokchan
turned his lighter on.

00:49:53.168 --> 00:49:56.088 line:80%
[lighter clinking]

00:49:57.131 --> 00:49:58.257 line:80%
[clinking echoes]

00:49:59.633 --> 00:50:01.260 line:80%
-[lighter clinks]
-[high-pitched ringing]

00:50:01.343 --> 00:50:03.178 line:80%
[Hyeokchan] <i>Why would you</i>
<i>ruin everything like this?</i>

00:50:03.262 --> 00:50:04.263 line:80%
[Sujin] <i>Stop it, Hyeokchan.</i>

00:50:04.346 --> 00:50:05.472 line:80%
[Hyeokchan] <i>Tell me!</i>

00:50:06.098 --> 00:50:07.224 line:80%
You have to remember.

00:50:07.308 --> 00:50:09.476 line:80%
None of it was your fault.

00:50:10.311 --> 00:50:13.105 line:80%
[Hyeokchan] <i>You've been talking to Haran</i>
<i>while I was away?</i>

00:50:13.188 --> 00:50:14.648 line:80%
<i>Pretending to be me? Why?</i>

00:50:14.732 --> 00:50:17.318 line:80%
<i>Did you think it was okay</i>
<i>since I asked you a few times?</i>

00:50:17.401 --> 00:50:19.778 line:80%
<i>You were someone nobody even cared about.</i>

00:50:21.113 --> 00:50:23.532 line:80%
Did you get excited

00:50:23.615 --> 00:50:25.242 line:80%
that someone paid attention to you?

00:50:25.743 --> 00:50:26.869 line:80%
Kang Hyeokchan!

00:50:26.952 --> 00:50:28.787 line:80%
[Haran] <i>You never hit Hyeokchan.</i>

00:50:33.876 --> 00:50:35.586 line:80%
<i>It was…</i>

00:50:40.966 --> 00:50:41.967 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:50:42.051 --> 00:50:44.887 line:80%
[Hyeokchan breathing heavily]

00:50:44.970 --> 00:50:46.263 line:80%
<i>…Hyeokchan who hit you.</i>

00:50:46.972 --> 00:50:48.641 line:80%
Tell me!

00:50:49.099 --> 00:50:50.809 line:80%
-[Sujin] Kang Hyeokchan!
-[thudding]

00:50:50.893 --> 00:50:53.228 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

00:50:55.856 --> 00:50:57.900 line:80%
[Chan] I have something to tell you.

00:50:58.692 --> 00:50:59.735 line:80%
Your messenger…

00:51:00.027 --> 00:51:01.028 line:80%
What?

00:51:02.905 --> 00:51:04.448 line:80%
While I was using your laptop,

00:51:04.948 --> 00:51:08.160 line:80%
I kept chatting with your girlfriend.

00:51:12.539 --> 00:51:13.666 line:80%
What?

00:51:15.876 --> 00:51:18.170 line:80%
What are you talking about?
Say that again.

00:51:19.254 --> 00:51:20.714 line:80%
We ended up

00:51:21.799 --> 00:51:23.092 line:80%
chatting after that.

00:51:24.259 --> 00:51:26.929 line:80%
But she thinks it was you.

00:51:28.973 --> 00:51:31.600 line:80%
[chuckling] Hyeokchan,
you left your earphones in my car…

00:51:33.769 --> 00:51:34.770 line:80%
[Hyeokchan] Are you saying

00:51:35.396 --> 00:51:39.775 line:80%
you've been talking to Haran
while I was away?

00:51:40.234 --> 00:51:41.235 line:80%
Pretending to be me?

00:51:44.613 --> 00:51:45.656 line:80%
Sorry.

00:51:50.035 --> 00:51:51.036 line:80%
Hang on.

00:51:52.746 --> 00:51:53.831 line:80%
Who are you to do that?

00:51:54.373 --> 00:51:57.793 line:80%
Why would you ruin everything like this?

00:51:58.085 --> 00:52:01.505 line:80%
[groans in frustration]
I was already feeling guilty

00:52:01.588 --> 00:52:03.590 line:80%
and wondering how to end things.

00:52:03.674 --> 00:52:05.676 line:80%
My head was already about to explode.

00:52:07.011 --> 00:52:08.762 line:80%
Do you have any idea what you've done?

00:52:12.683 --> 00:52:13.684 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:52:14.768 --> 00:52:15.811 line:80%
Tell me.

00:52:17.646 --> 00:52:20.190 line:80%
What sort of things have you been saying?

00:52:22.609 --> 00:52:24.320 line:80%
Tell me!

00:52:27.948 --> 00:52:29.283 line:80%
[Sujin] Kang Hyeokchan!

00:52:32.161 --> 00:52:35.205 line:80%
Who are you to take away
my chance to end things peacefully?

00:52:35.289 --> 00:52:38.250 line:80%
[sighing] What am I supposed to do now?

00:52:38.334 --> 00:52:39.626 line:80%
Why?

00:52:40.085 --> 00:52:42.629 line:80%
Did you think it was okay
since I asked you a few times?

00:52:42.713 --> 00:52:45.007 line:80%
You were someone nobody even cared about.

00:52:45.632 --> 00:52:47.426 line:80%
Did you get excited

00:52:49.470 --> 00:52:50.971 line:80%
that someone paid attention to you?

00:52:51.972 --> 00:52:53.515 line:80%
Stop it, Hyeokchan.

00:52:54.224 --> 00:52:56.644 line:80%
You're the one
who's been bad to your girlfriend.

00:52:57.269 --> 00:52:58.395 line:80%
No, it's us.

00:52:58.812 --> 00:53:00.064 line:80%
And you stopped liking her.

00:53:00.481 --> 00:53:02.149 line:80%
So don't take it out on your roommate.

00:53:04.860 --> 00:53:05.861 line:80%
[sighs]

00:53:07.321 --> 00:53:08.864 line:80%
[Sujin] You should leave for a moment.

00:53:08.947 --> 00:53:09.948 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:53:12.493 --> 00:53:13.494 line:80%
[sighs]

00:53:19.291 --> 00:53:21.043 line:80%
Are you crazy? We're in a lab.

00:53:21.502 --> 00:53:23.045 line:80%
You're smoking too much these days.

00:53:23.754 --> 00:53:24.797 line:80%
Watch yourself.

00:53:24.880 --> 00:53:26.882 line:80%
-[♪ foreboding music playing]
-[knock on door]

00:53:28.717 --> 00:53:29.927 line:80%
[in English] Here for pickup.

00:53:33.973 --> 00:53:35.891 line:80%
Never leave the waste container like this.

00:53:36.392 --> 00:53:38.811 line:80%
Even a small leak will set off the sensor.

00:53:38.894 --> 00:53:40.187 line:80%
Be careful.

00:53:40.270 --> 00:53:42.564 line:80%
Sorry. I will.

00:53:43.816 --> 00:53:47.069 line:80%
[Sujin in Korean] <i>The waste container had</i>
<i>nothing to do with the accident either,</i>

00:53:47.152 --> 00:53:48.696 line:80%
<i>because they collected it right away.</i>

00:53:49.571 --> 00:53:50.990 line:80%
<i>I was a witness.</i>

00:53:51.073 --> 00:53:52.074 line:80%
[Hyeokchan groans]

00:53:54.451 --> 00:53:55.577 line:80%
It's not too late.

00:53:57.705 --> 00:54:00.499 line:80%
Go back to Korea and meet your girlfriend.

00:54:01.542 --> 00:54:04.253 line:80%
Explain everything to her
and apologize properly.

00:54:04.336 --> 00:54:06.046 line:80%
And apologize to your roommate.

00:54:06.130 --> 00:54:07.339 line:80%
You're the one

00:54:07.423 --> 00:54:09.591 line:80%
who took his laptop
and asked him to cover for you.

00:54:09.675 --> 00:54:10.676 line:80%
[sighs]

00:54:10.759 --> 00:54:12.094 line:80%
You're in a dangerous state.

00:54:12.553 --> 00:54:15.431 line:80%
Just go and get some rest.
I'll get going now.

00:54:15.514 --> 00:54:16.932 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:54:23.522 --> 00:54:24.857 line:80%
[laptop pings]

00:54:28.736 --> 00:54:30.696 line:20%
[Haran] <i>Chan, I saw a vapor trail earlier.</i>

00:54:30.779 --> 00:54:33.282 line:20%
<i>But that made me want</i>
<i>to get on a plane to go see you.</i>

00:54:33.365 --> 00:54:34.575 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:54:35.159 --> 00:54:37.494 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

00:54:37.578 --> 00:54:38.746 line:80%
[sighs]

00:54:42.458 --> 00:54:45.294 line:80%
[lighter clinking]

00:54:46.503 --> 00:54:48.088 line:80%
[sighing wearily]

00:54:50.966 --> 00:54:51.967 line:80%
[lighter clinks]

00:54:52.051 --> 00:54:53.552 line:80%
-[gasps]
-[♪ music fades]

00:54:53.635 --> 00:54:55.304 line:80%
[Haran] <i>It wasn't your fault.</i>

00:54:55.387 --> 00:54:58.265 line:80%
<i>The one who made me want to rush over</i>

00:54:58.349 --> 00:54:59.808 line:80%
<i>and say "I love you"</i>

00:55:00.225 --> 00:55:01.602 line:80%
<i>was you, back then and now.</i>

00:55:01.685 --> 00:55:03.854 line:80%
[explosions]

00:55:03.937 --> 00:55:06.649 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing]

00:55:12.071 --> 00:55:13.489 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing fades]

00:55:13.989 --> 00:55:15.115 line:80%
<i>I love you.</i>

00:55:15.616 --> 00:55:17.034 line:80%
<i>I love you, Seonu Chan.</i>

00:55:38.639 --> 00:55:39.848 line:80%
[sighs softly]

00:56:01.078 --> 00:56:02.746 line:80%
[♪ mellow music playing]

00:56:14.842 --> 00:56:16.844 line:80%
[gasping]

00:56:19.930 --> 00:56:21.598 line:80%
[gasping]

00:56:21.682 --> 00:56:22.725 line:80%
Oh, no.

00:56:26.353 --> 00:56:28.230 line:80%
[sighs worriedly] Where did he go?

00:56:28.814 --> 00:56:30.190 line:80%
[doctor] <i>The detailed exam confirmed</i>

00:56:30.274 --> 00:56:33.027 line:80%
<i>the shrapnel had shifted</i>
<i>and was stimulating his nerves.</i>

00:56:33.110 --> 00:56:35.779 line:80%
<i>It caused memory disturbance</i>
<i>and hallucinations.</i>

00:56:35.863 --> 00:56:38.157 line:80%
<i>Luckily, it shifted</i>
<i>to an operable position,</i>

00:56:38.240 --> 00:56:40.200 line:80%
<i>so we were able to remove the shrapnel.</i>

00:56:41.660 --> 00:56:42.828 line:80%
[Chan] Song Haran.

00:56:45.247 --> 00:56:47.124 line:80%
[doctor] <i>But due to severe mental fatigue,</i>

00:56:47.207 --> 00:56:49.668 line:80%
<i>he hasn't been able to wake up</i>
<i>for several days.</i>

00:56:50.836 --> 00:56:52.254 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:57:02.973 --> 00:57:05.851 line:80%
<i>We'll have to wait until he wakes up</i>

00:57:06.852 --> 00:57:08.979 line:80%
<i>to see how the surgery</i>
<i>will affect his memories.</i>

00:57:15.361 --> 00:57:16.654 line:80%
[sighs]

00:57:20.616 --> 00:57:21.700 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Every time I see you,</i>

00:57:21.784 --> 00:57:24.787 line:80%
<i>I swallow the same words</i>
<i>stuck in my throat.</i>

00:57:28.040 --> 00:57:29.333 line:80%
11. WHAT I WANT TO TELL YOU

00:57:30.042 --> 00:57:31.043 line:80%
<i>But…</i>

00:57:31.460 --> 00:57:32.795 line:20%
<i>I won't swallow them anymore.</i>

00:57:33.837 --> 00:57:36.465 line:80%
<i>I'm going to tell you</i>
<i>when I meet you today.</i>

00:57:37.966 --> 00:57:39.677 line:80%
<i>The words I decided to say to you</i>

00:57:39.760 --> 00:57:42.012 line:80%
<i>the moment my memories</i>
<i>were fully recovered.</i>

00:57:42.096 --> 00:57:43.097 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:57:44.890 --> 00:57:45.975 line:80%
I love you.

00:57:46.558 --> 00:57:48.435 line:80%
[♪ emotional song playing]

00:57:51.146 --> 00:57:55.192 line:80%
I LOVE YOU
I LOVE YOU, SONG HARAN

00:58:15.629 --> 00:58:17.589 line:80%
I love you, Song Haran.

00:58:21.677 --> 00:58:23.345 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:59:28.911 --> 00:59:29.995 line:80%
[♪ song fades]

00:59:30.871 --> 00:59:32.373 line:80%
-[Sol cheers]
-[Seunggyu gasps]

00:59:33.832 --> 00:59:35.876 line:80%
-[in English] Music start!
-[Sol exclaims]

00:59:35.959 --> 00:59:38.295 line:80%
[♪ upbeat music playing]

00:59:43.467 --> 00:59:46.887 line:80%
-[♪ band playing "La Vie En Rose"]
-[guests cheering]

00:59:50.808 --> 00:59:52.101 line:80%
[exclaims]

00:59:52.184 --> 00:59:54.228 line:80%
[cheering]

00:59:54.770 --> 00:59:56.188 line:80%
[guests in Korean] Congratulations!

01:00:03.862 --> 01:00:05.155 line:80%
[Sol] Congratulations!

01:00:14.999 --> 01:00:16.792 line:80%
[Genius barking]

01:00:28.137 --> 01:00:29.138 line:80%
Okay.

01:00:33.559 --> 01:00:35.686 line:80%
[all chuckling]

01:00:36.270 --> 01:00:38.272 line:80%
[all cheering]

01:00:43.319 --> 01:00:45.529 line:80%
[guests cheering, applauding]

01:00:50.909 --> 01:00:52.619 line:80%
Kiss!

01:00:52.703 --> 01:00:55.706 line:80%
-Kiss.
-Kiss.

01:00:55.789 --> 01:00:58.375 line:80%
[all] Kiss.

01:00:58.459 --> 01:00:59.710 line:80%
-Kiss…
-[♪ music fades]

01:01:00.294 --> 01:01:01.295 line:80%
[chuckles]

01:01:03.547 --> 01:01:05.758 line:80%
[♪ lighthearted music playing]

01:01:05.841 --> 01:01:08.469 line:80%
[squealing, exclaiming]

01:01:08.552 --> 01:01:10.804 line:80%
[Hayeong] Oh, my gosh!
He really did it! [gasps]

01:01:15.559 --> 01:01:17.519 line:80%
[Sol and Pureum] Congratulations.

01:01:25.444 --> 01:01:26.779 line:80%
[both chuckle]

01:01:28.405 --> 01:01:29.782 line:80%
[cheering]

01:01:39.333 --> 01:01:40.542 line:80%
[Yougyum] Here.

01:01:40.626 --> 01:01:42.670 line:80%
What? A baseball?

01:01:43.837 --> 01:01:46.674 line:80%
The ball from my final strikeout
that got me my first win.

01:01:46.757 --> 01:01:48.300 line:80%
I wanted to give it to you.

01:01:49.134 --> 01:01:51.595 line:80%
I know I'm still in the minor leagues.

01:01:52.846 --> 01:01:53.847 line:80%
Thank you, Hadam.

01:01:54.306 --> 01:01:55.891 line:80%
For not letting me give up.

01:01:55.975 --> 01:01:59.436 line:80%
Thank you for not giving up until the end.

01:02:01.146 --> 01:02:02.147 line:80%
[chuckles]

01:02:02.731 --> 01:02:04.525 line:80%
But now that I think about it,

01:02:04.608 --> 01:02:07.236 line:80%
-we were so immature.
-What?

01:02:07.319 --> 01:02:09.571 line:80%
We thought we'd feel too anxious
being apart,

01:02:09.655 --> 01:02:11.657 line:80%
so we thought
marriage was our only option.

01:02:11.740 --> 01:02:13.117 line:80%
-[♪ music ends]
-[chuckles softly]

01:02:13.200 --> 01:02:17.746 line:80%
But now, no matter how far apart we are,
I don't feel anxious at all.

01:02:17.830 --> 01:02:20.582 line:80%
Right. I don't feel anxious at all.

01:02:20.666 --> 01:02:22.292 line:80%
[inhales sharply]

01:02:22.376 --> 01:02:24.962 line:80%
Have we… matured?

01:02:25.921 --> 01:02:28.132 line:80%
[both chuckle]

01:02:28.215 --> 01:02:30.426 line:80%
Keep up with your rehab
during the offseason

01:02:30.884 --> 01:02:33.679 line:80%
and get yourself in perfect shape
before the spring camp.

01:02:33.762 --> 01:02:34.847 line:80%
Okay.

01:02:35.431 --> 01:02:36.432 line:80%
And…

01:02:37.933 --> 01:02:39.184 line:80%
sign this for me.

01:02:39.268 --> 01:02:41.061 line:80%
I'm your number one fan, remember?

01:02:42.646 --> 01:02:43.647 line:80%
I already signed it.

01:02:45.816 --> 01:02:48.610 line:80%
TO MY NO. 1 DOCTOR HADAM
I'M ALWAYS ROOTING FOR YOU, CHA YOUGYUM

01:02:53.115 --> 01:02:54.825 line:80%
I'm your number one fan too.

01:02:58.662 --> 01:02:59.830 line:80%
Hey!

01:02:59.913 --> 01:03:00.914 line:80%
[both laugh]

01:03:05.502 --> 01:03:08.547 line:80%
-[Pureum] Isn't B better?
-[Seunggyu] Yes, B is better.

01:03:08.630 --> 01:03:09.715 line:80%
Who prefers option A?

01:03:10.841 --> 01:03:12.926 line:80%
What? It's 3 to 3?

01:03:13.010 --> 01:03:14.303 line:80%
What should we do, then?

01:03:14.386 --> 01:03:16.472 line:80%
[♪ exhilarating music playing]

01:03:19.767 --> 01:03:20.768 line:80%
[Nana] C.

01:03:21.727 --> 01:03:22.728 line:80%
Ms. Kim!

01:03:24.188 --> 01:03:25.606 line:80%
Ms. Kim is here.

01:03:26.815 --> 01:03:28.651 line:80%
When you're not sure about both A and B,

01:03:29.068 --> 01:03:30.569 line:80%
-then it's C.
-[Raemee] But, Ms. Kim,

01:03:30.653 --> 01:03:33.864 line:80%
you said you'd take a year off
with Mr. Park in France.

01:03:33.947 --> 01:03:37.201 line:80%
A month was enough.
Taking a long break isn't my thing.

01:03:37.284 --> 01:03:41.246 line:80%
All right, then I'll be expecting
an upgraded option.

01:03:41.330 --> 01:03:43.582 line:80%
-Okay.
-Yes, Ms. Kim.

01:03:43.666 --> 01:03:45.250 line:80%
[Hayeong] All right, then.

01:03:45.334 --> 01:03:47.586 line:80%
Let's prepare option C.

01:03:47.670 --> 01:03:48.671 line:80%
[Sol] Let's begin.

01:03:48.754 --> 01:03:50.005 line:80%
-[Pureum] Let's do this.
-[Sol] Clean this.

01:03:50.089 --> 01:03:51.173 line:80%
Let's do this!

01:03:53.300 --> 01:03:55.219 line:80%
Are you heading out now, Ms. Song?

01:03:55.886 --> 01:03:58.639 line:80%
Congratulations on the bio-silk reorder.

01:03:59.390 --> 01:04:02.267 line:80%
Right. Thank you so much.

01:04:02.351 --> 01:04:04.269 line:80%
Is there something wrong?

01:04:04.353 --> 01:04:06.647 line:80%
Even outside the office,

01:04:06.730 --> 01:04:08.691 line:80%
you're always calling me Ms. Song.

01:04:08.774 --> 01:04:09.775 line:80%
Nothing's changed…

01:04:11.610 --> 01:04:13.028 line:80%
Forget it. [sighs]

01:04:13.112 --> 01:04:16.490 line:80%
Ms. Song Hayeong will head home now,

01:04:16.573 --> 01:04:18.158 line:80%
COO Yeon Taeseok.

01:04:19.368 --> 01:04:20.369 line:80%
[chuckles]

01:04:22.705 --> 01:04:23.831 line:80%
Hayeong.

01:04:23.914 --> 01:04:25.916 line:80%
[♪ heart-fluttering song playing]

01:04:37.511 --> 01:04:39.847 line:80%
Do you have to go home early today?

01:04:40.431 --> 01:04:43.767 line:80%
If I don't, then…

01:04:45.019 --> 01:04:46.270 line:80%
I mean,

01:04:46.353 --> 01:04:49.440 line:80%
it would be nice to have dinner
and watch a movie.

01:04:51.483 --> 01:04:53.152 line:80%
That sounds good.

01:04:53.235 --> 01:04:54.987 line:80%
I like movies.

01:04:56.405 --> 01:04:57.531 line:80%
Let's go.

01:05:00.242 --> 01:05:01.618 line:80%
-This way.
-[in English] Okay!

01:05:02.161 --> 01:05:03.162 line:80%
[♪ song fades]

01:05:03.245 --> 01:05:05.247 line:80%
[waves crashing]

01:05:11.211 --> 01:05:14.798 line:80%
[in Korean] Oh? What's that face?
You'd better not draw me weird.

01:05:14.882 --> 01:05:16.717 line:80%
Come on. I'm Seonu Chan.

01:05:16.800 --> 01:05:18.218 line:80%
Don't you know my skills?

01:05:18.886 --> 01:05:19.887 line:80%
All done.

01:05:19.970 --> 01:05:21.597 line:80%
Oh. Hang on. Give me just 10 seconds.

01:05:24.433 --> 01:05:27.269 line:80%
Let's close our eyes
and exchange them on the count of three.

01:05:28.020 --> 01:05:30.272 line:80%
One, two, three.

01:05:30.773 --> 01:05:32.650 line:80%
Oh! You're pretty good.

01:05:33.108 --> 01:05:35.194 line:80%
Why aren't you showing me yours?

01:05:35.277 --> 01:05:38.280 line:80%
Ah. I forgot. Can you count again?

01:05:39.114 --> 01:05:40.324 line:80%
All right.

01:05:40.407 --> 01:05:42.409 line:80%
One, two, three.

01:05:47.623 --> 01:05:49.375 line:80%
[♪ pleasant song playing]

01:06:02.805 --> 01:06:06.392 line:80%
Let's go see cherry blossoms in spring,

01:06:06.976 --> 01:06:09.019 line:80%
eat shaved ice in summer,

01:06:09.520 --> 01:06:10.854 line:80%
see the autumn leaves in fall,

01:06:10.938 --> 01:06:14.274 line:80%
-and go snowboarding in winter.
-[chuckles softly]

01:06:14.358 --> 01:06:15.567 line:80%
Will you share

01:06:16.276 --> 01:06:18.070 line:80%
every season of life with me

01:06:20.030 --> 01:06:21.115 line:80%
from now on?

01:06:30.124 --> 01:06:31.125 line:80%
[whines]

01:06:32.084 --> 01:06:34.503 line:80%
You should stand up to match the drawing.

01:06:35.170 --> 01:06:36.797 line:80%
Huh? [chuckles]

01:06:38.549 --> 01:06:39.550 line:80%
[Chan] Hmm.

01:06:47.725 --> 01:06:48.726 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

01:07:01.113 --> 01:07:03.824 line:80%
Thank you for appearing in my life.

01:07:03.907 --> 01:07:05.159 line:80%
I told you,

01:07:05.784 --> 01:07:07.411 line:80%
I'll appear anywhere for you.

01:07:09.997 --> 01:07:11.582 line:80%
Thank you

01:07:11.665 --> 01:07:13.125 line:80%
for appearing

01:07:13.792 --> 01:07:16.420 line:80%
in my life and in my winter.

01:07:24.053 --> 01:07:25.471 line:80%
[♪ song continues]

01:07:51.038 --> 01:07:53.207 line:80%
[gasps] The cherry blossoms are beautiful.

01:07:53.290 --> 01:07:54.875 line:80%
-[Haran laughs]
-[Chan chuckles]

01:07:54.958 --> 01:07:56.251 line:80%
-[Chan] This looks delicious.
-[Haran] Here.

01:07:56.335 --> 01:07:58.128 line:80%
-[Chan] Mm! Isn't it good?
-Mm!

01:08:14.311 --> 01:08:15.312 line:80%
This is nice.

01:08:15.729 --> 01:08:16.855 line:80%
[both chuckle]

01:08:30.786 --> 01:08:31.954 line:80%
-[♪ music fades]
-[laptop pings]

01:08:32.579 --> 01:08:33.622 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Chan! Chan!</i>

01:08:33.706 --> 01:08:35.582 line:80%
<i>I read somewhere</i>

01:08:35.666 --> 01:08:38.252 line:80%
<i>that the seasons in life</i>
<i>don't come in order.</i>

01:08:38.335 --> 01:08:41.130 line:80%
<i>What if winter suddenly comes to my life?</i>

01:08:49.888 --> 01:08:51.307 line:80%
[sharp inhale]

01:08:55.019 --> 01:08:56.854 line:80%
[Chan] <i>It will pass one day.</i>

01:08:57.396 --> 01:08:59.523 line:80%
<i>Even if winter feels endless,</i>

01:08:59.606 --> 01:09:01.734 line:80%
<i>a spring breeze might blow someday</i>

01:09:02.359 --> 01:09:04.695 line:80%
<i>once you keep fighting through it.</i>

